(1490348, 195915, 11738, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty sure that border isn''t legal.  Voting on the image''s quality never the same.  Very harsh light from flash.</td>', 'I''m pretty sure that border isn''t legal.  Voting on the image''s quality never the same.  Very harsh light from flash.', '2005-06-29 08:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1490349, 196448, 34906, '<td valign="top">Very touching and thought provoking image. everything came together.</td>', 'Very touching and thought provoking image. everything came together.', '2005-06-29 08:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1490350, 197602, 37257, '<td valign="top">eeeeeewwwwww!!!!! good shot though</td>', 'eeeeeewwwwww!!!!! good shot though', '2005-06-29 08:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1490354, 195844, 5354, '<td valign="top">This fits the subject perfectly, however the execution just falls flat. What you have ended up with is a simple ''record'' shot of a coal truck.<br/>It looks to me as though you took this at the height of midday in bright overhead sunlight. Now just imagine if you had taken this in low evening or morning sun and maybe kicked up some of that dust. That would have been very atmospheric.<br/>I hope that explains why I can''t give it more than a 5.</td>', 'This fits the subject perfectly, however the execution just falls flat. What you have ended up with is a simple ''record'' shot of a coal truck.It looks to me as though you took this at the height of midday in bright overhead sunlight. Now just imagine if you had taken this in low evening or morning sun and maybe kicked up some of that dust. That would have been very atmospheric.I hope that explains why I can''t give it more than a 5.', '2005-06-29 08:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1490357, 195941, 34746, '<td valign="top">Cool image! is this smoke? I love it!</td>', 'Cool image! is this smoke? I love it!', '2005-06-29 08:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1490358, 195924, 37257, '<td valign="top">beautiful picture, but I''m not sure that it fits the theme</td>', 'beautiful picture, but I''m not sure that it fits the theme', '2005-06-29 08:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1490363, 196457, 11738, '<td valign="top">That spot without a photo above the baby is very distracting. The other areas to the right and left aren''t so bad because they are darker.</td>', 'That spot without a photo above the baby is very distracting. The other areas to the right and left aren''t so bad because they are darker.', '2005-06-29 08:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1490364, 197053, 888, '<td valign="top">good god noooooooo.  WHy would anyone want to use nasty palstic dolls that look like ken and barby had chemo??<br/> <br/>We must fight to stop our woodys being obsolete!!<br/> <br/>Nice pic, something a bit funny along the bottom, is that compression artefactsor dirt on the table?<br/></td>', 'good god noooooooo.  WHy would anyone want to use nasty palstic dolls that look like ken and barby had chemo?? We must fight to stop our woodys being obsolete!! Nice pic, something a bit funny along the bottom, is that compression artefactsor dirt on the table?', '2005-06-29 08:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1490367, 197408, 11738, '<td valign="top">Strong centered composition.  Good work.</td>', 'Strong centered composition.  Good work.', '2005-06-29 08:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1490374, 197249, 39553, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really say obselete unfortunately... just a nice architectural composition...</td>', 'Doesn''t really say obselete unfortunately... just a nice architectural composition...', '2005-06-29 08:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1490375, 197312, 37719, '<td valign="top">There were a lot of shots of vinyl.  But they all tried to make the record look ''good.''  This one has character and the record looks old, aged, and worn out.  I like the perspective and that the shot is only a portion of the whole.  Nice shot!</td>', 'There were a lot of shots of vinyl.  But they all tried to make the record look ''good.''  This one has character and the record looks old, aged, and worn out.  I like the perspective and that the shot is only a portion of the whole.  Nice shot!', '2005-06-29 08:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1490376, 196489, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset.  That said, the boat isn''t obsolete since it is sitting is a perfect good boat lift, meaning that it is still being used, thus not obsolete.  This is a great image of a sunset that combines good silhouette work.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice sunset.  That said, the boat isn''t obsolete since it is sitting is a perfect good boat lift, meaning that it is still being used, thus not obsolete.  This is a great image of a sunset that combines good silhouette work.  Good job.', '2005-06-29 08:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1490377, 196218, 5354, '<td valign="top">Too small - need to use the full 640 pixels</td>', 'Too small - need to use the full 640 pixels', '2005-06-29 08:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1490380, 197616, 35467, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet they could tell a story or two,  good luck</td>', 'I''ll bet they could tell a story or two,  good luck', '2005-06-29 08:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1490381, 197402, 11738, '<td valign="top">Can you imagine riding that on any hard packed road.  Talk about a bone-jarring ride!  CLANG-CLANG-CLANG-CLANG-CLANG!</td>', 'Can you imagine riding that on any hard packed road.  Talk about a bone-jarring ride!  CLANG-CLANG-CLANG-CLANG-CLANG!', '2005-06-29 08:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1490382, 196104, 39553, '<td valign="top">Washing machines per se aren''t obselete though... is the car deliberately in the background?  Nice sky though!</td>', 'Washing machines per se aren''t obselete though... is the car deliberately in the background?  Nice sky though!', '2005-06-29 08:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1490387, 194262, 5354, '<td valign="top">Very dark, needs more light to make it zing</td>', 'Very dark, needs more light to make it zing', '2005-06-29 08:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1490388, 196136, 34906, '<td valign="top">The title and the image are a perfect fit in this impressive capture.  I really like this one.</td>', 'The title and the image are a perfect fit in this impressive capture.  I really like this one.', '2005-06-29 08:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1490390, 195786, 39553, '<td valign="top">A chair in good condition isn''t obselete is it?</td>', 'A chair in good condition isn''t obselete is it?', '2005-06-29 08:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
