(1490396, 197275, 5354, '<td valign="top">Oh with that location there''s so much more you could have done with this image. It begs for a low sun to get the reflections of the wet sand, and if you went closer you could have all those wet boulders as a superb foreground. You had a fantastic opportunity here, but sadly failed to take best advantage of it. Shame.</td>', 'Oh with that location there''s so much more you could have done with this image. It begs for a low sun to get the reflections of the wet sand, and if you went closer you could have all those wet boulders as a superb foreground. You had a fantastic opportunity here, but sadly failed to take best advantage of it. Shame.', '2005-06-29 08:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1490397, 195424, 39386, '<td valign="top">Very Good pic for obsolete.</td>', 'Very Good pic for obsolete.', '2005-06-29 08:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1490399, 197512, 11738, '<td valign="top">I find this shot way to busy.  Hard to find a spot on which the eye can rest.  There also seems to be a yellow cast to the image, although this may be what was wanted.</td>', 'I find this shot way to busy.  Hard to find a spot on which the eye can rest.  There also seems to be a yellow cast to the image, although this may be what was wanted.', '2005-06-29 08:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
