(1490762, 196960, 15711, '<td valign="top">I thought of a drive in.  So glad somebody found one to photograph.  Great contrast. Nice use of lighting. Maybe taken later in the day and the shadow under the for sale sign would have been longer, creating yet another point of interest.  Overall: 8</td>', 'I thought of a drive in.  So glad somebody found one to photograph.  Great contrast. Nice use of lighting. Maybe taken later in the day and the shadow under the for sale sign would have been longer, creating yet another point of interest.  Overall: 8', '2005-06-29 10:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1490765, 197645, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I think my favorite so far.  Love the yellow and blue - opposites on the color wheel. Nice angle of the shot. 8</td>', 'Very nice. I think my favorite so far.  Love the yellow and blue - opposites on the color wheel. Nice angle of the shot. 8', '2005-06-29 10:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
