(1491058, 197060, 29269, '<td valign="top">I actually like the grainness in this photo - it may not do very well in general, but it seems perfect choice for this challenge.<br/>Composition is good, as everything in this image is obsolete. However, the total effect is of lacking focal point, main object. That''s where you could have done better. 7.</td>', 'I actually like the grainness in this photo - it may not do very well in general, but it seems perfect choice for this challenge.Composition is good, as everything in this image is obsolete. However, the total effect is of lacking focal point, main object. That''s where you could have done better. 7.', '2005-06-29 11:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
