(1491816, 196006, 34058, '<td valign="top">Is that a buckeye tree?  lol! Nice picture!!</td>', 'Is that a buckeye tree?  lol! Nice picture!!', '2005-06-29 14:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491820, 195424, 24454, '<td valign="top">Good job.    I love this photo.   It really has a nice, old-timey feel to it.</td>', 'Good job.    I love this photo.   It really has a nice, old-timey feel to it.', '2005-06-29 14:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491821, 196950, 39249, '<td valign="top">Ha Ha! I love it! Very original idea! Great contrast.</td>', 'Ha Ha! I love it! Very original idea! Great contrast.', '2005-06-29 14:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491822, 197550, 39239, '<td valign="top">refreshing shot of a subject I am quickly getting tired of seeing.  Love the spiderwebs, and the lighting.</td>', 'refreshing shot of a subject I am quickly getting tired of seeing.  Love the spiderwebs, and the lighting.', '2005-06-29 14:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491824, 197549, 20530, '<td valign="top">I''ve got one of these. It still takes good pictures. Love the angle. Is it me, or is there a lot of noise? I think it might have been better if the top corner was not cropped off and the background didn''t have reflections.</td>', 'I''ve got one of these. It still takes good pictures. Love the angle. Is it me, or is there a lot of noise? I think it might have been better if the top corner was not cropped off and the background didn''t have reflections.', '2005-06-29 14:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491827, 196906, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo!!!    The vibrant red looks great against what looks almost like a black and white background.    It looks like a poster, or a framed wall print.   I love it.  10</td>', 'Very cool photo!!!    The vibrant red looks great against what looks almost like a black and white background.    It looks like a poster, or a framed wall print.   I love it.  10', '2005-06-29 14:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491828, 195056, 3669, '<td valign="top">I know this is picky, so please forgive me.  This is obviously a restored (painted) wheel.  You did well in capturing it with the close crop and the lighting is nice.  I think it would look more authenic in B&amp;W.</td>', 'I know this is picky, so please forgive me.  This is obviously a restored (painted) wheel.  You did well in capturing it with the close crop and the lighting is nice.  I think it would look more authenic in B&W.', '2005-06-29 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491831, 197552, 39249, '<td valign="top">Funky lighting and it''s really fuzzy. The red background is REALLY distracting.I have a hard time looking at it. Sorry.</td>', 'Funky lighting and it''s really fuzzy. The red background is REALLY distracting.I have a hard time looking at it. Sorry.', '2005-06-29 14:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491832, 195676, 39679, '<td valign="top">Nice use of perspective and depth of field control.  I just realized that my comment reads like a grade school exam comment...sorry about that.</td>', 'Nice use of perspective and depth of field control.  I just realized that my comment reads like a grade school exam comment...sorry about that.', '2005-06-29 14:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491833, 195091, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very wel done.   How did you keep that record so shiny and new looking?   All mine are beat up, scratched and well. . . .totally obsolete  :)</td>', 'Very wel done.   How did you keep that record so shiny and new looking?   All mine are beat up, scratched and well. . . .totally obsolete  :)', '2005-06-29 14:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491834, 195515, 24454, '<td valign="top">Cool angle.</td>', 'Cool angle.', '2005-06-29 14:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491836, 196026, 20530, '<td valign="top">Cool wagon. Probably a little busy to suit my taste. Lighting is also a bit harsh.</td>', 'Cool wagon. Probably a little busy to suit my taste. Lighting is also a bit harsh.', '2005-06-29 14:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491837, 196920, 39249, '<td valign="top">And how old are you? =)  I like it. Not sure what else to say...</td>', 'And how old are you? =)  I like it. Not sure what else to say...', '2005-06-29 14:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491838, 194802, 20530, '<td valign="top">Funny. My husband thought it was obsolete as soon as he played it.</td>', 'Funny. My husband thought it was obsolete as soon as he played it.', '2005-06-29 14:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491841, 197546, 39249, '<td valign="top">Pretty good lighting, but the focus begs to be better.</td>', 'Pretty good lighting, but the focus begs to be better.', '2005-06-29 14:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491843, 196759, 32513, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of potential.</td>', 'This has a lot of potential.', '2005-06-29 14:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491845, 196096, 24454, '<td valign="top">Good job!  This really appeals to me  alot!   The photo speaks for itself, and is composed very well.    But that''s okay too that it has such a long, explanatory title  :)    Good luck.  9</td>', 'Good job!  This really appeals to me  alot!   The photo speaks for itself, and is composed very well.    But that''s okay too that it has such a long, explanatory title  :)    Good luck.  9', '2005-06-29 14:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491847, 195682, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I might have cropped more at the bottom though.  The sepia tone is nice and fitting.  The painting makes for a nice background.  9</td>', 'Nicely done.  I might have cropped more at the bottom though.  The sepia tone is nice and fitting.  The painting makes for a nice background.  9', '2005-06-29 14:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491848, 195942, 39239, '<td valign="top">Love the blue light.</td>', 'Love the blue light.', '2005-06-29 14:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491851, 196101, 20530, '<td valign="top">Really like the Shallow DOF and the monocramatic look. The stones or the crab make an interesting image. For me, it''s a little too much going on at once. Still  very nice though.</td>', 'Really like the Shallow DOF and the monocramatic look. The stones or the crab make an interesting image. For me, it''s a little too much going on at once. Still  very nice though.', '2005-06-29 14:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491852, 196960, 39239, '<td valign="top">beautiful picture, love the angle, and the use of black and white.</td>', 'beautiful picture, love the angle, and the use of black and white.', '2005-06-29 14:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491853, 194785, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very pretty photo!!!!!   It ooks like a painting.</td>', 'Very pretty photo!!!!!   It ooks like a painting.', '2005-06-29 14:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491855, 196284, 39249, '<td valign="top">I''m not exactly sure what it is. Nice lighting though.</td>', 'I''m not exactly sure what it is. Nice lighting though.', '2005-06-29 14:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491856, 196476, 34058, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color in the sky!</td>', 'Beautiful color in the sky!', '2005-06-29 14:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491857, 196847, 3669, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge.  I think a tighter crop might have been effective.</td>', 'Good take on the challenge.  I think a tighter crop might have been effective.', '2005-06-29 14:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491858, 197414, 20530, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.</td>', 'Nice abstract.', '2005-06-29 14:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491859, 197529, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oooooooh. . . that certainly is old &amp; obsolete, isn''t it?   How did you find that!   Great fit for the challenge!</td>', 'Oooooooh. . . that certainly is old & obsolete, isn''t it?   How did you find that!   Great fit for the challenge!', '2005-06-29 14:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491860, 195777, 32513, '<td valign="top">Wow! Now that is REALLY narrow depth of field! I might show more of the subject though, I had to really think about this for a moment before I got it....</td>', 'Wow! Now that is REALLY narrow depth of field! I might show more of the subject though, I had to really think about this for a moment before I got it....', '2005-06-29 14:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491862, 194262, 39249, '<td valign="top">Isn''t that the car on Indiana Jones and the Temple of Doom? A little dark.</td>', 'Isn''t that the car on Indiana Jones and the Temple of Doom? A little dark.', '2005-06-29 14:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491863, 197302, 20530, '<td valign="top">Definitely meets the challenge.</td>', 'Definitely meets the challenge.', '2005-06-29 15:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491866, 197549, 38492, '<td valign="top">Too tightly cropped.</td>', 'Too tightly cropped.', '2005-06-29 15:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491868, 197407, 3669, '<td valign="top">A very pretty picture and nicely focused.  I really like the colors.  I''m just not sure what the subject is and what it was used for.  8</td>', 'A very pretty picture and nicely focused.  I really like the colors.  I''m just not sure what the subject is and what it was used for.  8', '2005-06-29 15:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491869, 196351, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I love this photo!    It just grabs me.   I love the scene, and the colors of the time of day, and the grass blowing in the breeze.   This is one of my favorites in this challenge.  10</td>', 'Wow!  I love this photo!    It just grabs me.   I love the scene, and the colors of the time of day, and the grass blowing in the breeze.   This is one of my favorites in this challenge.  10', '2005-06-29 15:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491870, 196957, 39239, '<td valign="top">This shot is a bit blurry and pixelated probably due to too much compression.</td>', 'This shot is a bit blurry and pixelated probably due to too much compression.', '2005-06-29 15:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491871, 197540, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this!   Even your border makes it look like a very old photo.   Great job.  10</td>', 'I love this!   Even your border makes it look like a very old photo.   Great job.  10', '2005-06-29 15:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491874, 197555, 20530, '<td valign="top">Looks like this one is glad to be obsolete. Not sure how I feel about the vertical bars in background. That animal could use some vertical stripes itself. Man, that thing is fat:)</td>', 'Looks like this one is glad to be obsolete. Not sure how I feel about the vertical bars in background. That animal could use some vertical stripes itself. Man, that thing is fat:)', '2005-06-29 15:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491875, 195769, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great job.  I sure hope Mr. Rudnicki has another source of income, huh?   I love photos like this.</td>', 'Great job.  I sure hope Mr. Rudnicki has another source of income, huh?   I love photos like this.', '2005-06-29 15:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491876, 196701, 38578, '<td valign="top">I really like the subject matter in this shot.  The lighting seemd a little to dark to me, and keeps ithe arrowheads from popping, especially at the corners.</td>', 'I really like the subject matter in this shot.  The lighting seemd a little to dark to me, and keeps ithe arrowheads from popping, especially at the corners.', '2005-06-29 15:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491877, 195183, 34058, '<td valign="top">Good color, sharp and in focus, but a bit busy.  Not really anything to lay your eyes on.</td>', 'Good color, sharp and in focus, but a bit busy.  Not really anything to lay your eyes on.', '2005-06-29 15:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491878, 197178, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very well done!   the lighting and focus is perfect!</td>', 'Very well done!   the lighting and focus is perfect!', '2005-06-29 15:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491881, 196994, 20530, '<td valign="top">Like the angle and the DOF. Nice touch with the weeds in foreground.  One of the better abandoned auto images I''ve seen.</td>', 'Like the angle and the DOF. Nice touch with the weeds in foreground.  One of the better abandoned auto images I''ve seen.', '2005-06-29 15:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491882, 197255, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.  However, the picture is overexposed and appears over sharpened.  Try taking this picture later in the day or use a shorter exposure time.</td>', 'Nice subject.  However, the picture is overexposed and appears over sharpened.  Try taking this picture later in the day or use a shorter exposure time.', '2005-06-29 15:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491883, 196956, 34058, '<td valign="top">Great picture I just wish it was bigger</td>', 'Great picture I just wish it was bigger', '2005-06-29 15:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491885, 194850, 38492, '<td valign="top">This has a distinct charm, but because of or in spite of the low resolution, I don''t know!</td>', 'This has a distinct charm, but because of or in spite of the low resolution, I don''t know!', '2005-06-29 15:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491886, 197035, 39733, '<td valign="top">nice pic</td>', 'nice pic', '2005-06-29 15:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491888, 196783, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo.   Scenes like this with the tree-covered mountains surrounding your subject appeal to me so much.  Anything would look great in a scene like this  -- even something so old and obsolete.   I love it!</td>', 'Very cool photo.   Scenes like this with the tree-covered mountains surrounding your subject appeal to me so much.  Anything would look great in a scene like this  -- even something so old and obsolete.   I love it!', '2005-06-29 15:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491889, 196388, 20530, '<td valign="top">Would like to see more chain and less whatever is in the background. Nice contrast and diagonal.</td>', 'Would like to see more chain and less whatever is in the background. Nice contrast and diagonal.', '2005-06-29 15:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491891, 197193, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great, interesting composition.</td>', 'Great, interesting composition.', '2005-06-29 15:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491892, 196616, 38492, '<td valign="top">Too small, and bright right hand corner is distracting. lines are good, though. 5</td>', 'Too small, and bright right hand corner is distracting. lines are good, though. 5', '2005-06-29 15:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491893, 196792, 37719, '<td valign="top">Something about this picture bothers me - it is very pixelated - was this intentional?  It has a distinct cut and pasted look to it and the background looks false - like it has been ''painted'' or ''filled'' in.</td>', 'Something about this picture bothers me - it is very pixelated - was this intentional?  It has a distinct cut and pasted look to it and the background looks false - like it has been ''painted'' or ''filled'' in.', '2005-06-29 15:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491894, 195116, 39239, '<td valign="top">good idea, would like to have seen it on a solid surface as opposed to the carpet.  Distracts from the shot.</td>', 'good idea, would like to have seen it on a solid surface as opposed to the carpet.  Distracts from the shot.', '2005-06-29 15:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491896, 197555, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awww, he looks mighty fat and happy  :)   I love it!</td>', 'Awww, he looks mighty fat and happy  :)   I love it!', '2005-06-29 15:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491897, 197190, 34058, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but the yellow spot on the wall is a little distracting</td>', 'Great idea, but the yellow spot on the wall is a little distracting', '2005-06-29 15:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491898, 196926, 20530, '<td valign="top">Perfect choice of a white background. Nice to see something different that meets the challenge.</td>', 'Perfect choice of a white background. Nice to see something different that meets the challenge.', '2005-06-29 15:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491903, 196639, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this.   This scene looks so vintage and old-timey.   Great fit for the challenge.</td>', 'I love this.   This scene looks so vintage and old-timey.   Great fit for the challenge.', '2005-06-29 15:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491904, 196818, 20530, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but I''m not crazy about the composition or the lighting.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but I''m not crazy about the composition or the lighting.', '2005-06-29 15:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491906, 196821, 24454, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Cute idea.  Nice composition.', '2005-06-29 15:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491907, 195533, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwww. . .. poor fellow!   He is working a LOT harder than he needs to, isn''t he.   Great fit for this challenge.   I  love it.</td>', 'Awwww. . .. poor fellow!   He is working a LOT harder than he needs to, isn''t he.   Great fit for this challenge.   I  love it.', '2005-06-29 15:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491910, 197380, 20530, '<td valign="top">What a lovely scene.  Though I think the mower itself would make for a nice image, with less of the landscape showing.</td>', 'What a lovely scene.  Though I think the mower itself would make for a nice image, with less of the landscape showing.', '2005-06-29 15:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491911, 196143, 28801, '<td valign="top">This is really a creative (and humorous) idea.  The black and white fits too. Nice one.</td>', 'This is really a creative (and humorous) idea.  The black and white fits too. Nice one.', '2005-06-29 15:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491913, 195782, 24454, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.   It looks old and has a lot of character and interest.   Good luck.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.   It looks old and has a lot of character and interest.   Good luck.', '2005-06-29 15:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491914, 197640, 37719, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo.  I really plike that you stood the coins up - creative.  The shadows really add to the image as  well.  Nice job!</td>', 'Very interesting photo.  I really plike that you stood the coins up - creative.  The shadows really add to the image as  well.  Nice job!', '2005-06-29 15:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491916, 195056, 24454, '<td valign="top">Way to go making an old, obsolete wagon wheel look so appealing and interesting to look at  :)</td>', 'Way to go making an old, obsolete wagon wheel look so appealing and interesting to look at  :)', '2005-06-29 15:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491917, 196990, 3669, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections.  Good job.</td>', 'I like the reflections.  Good job.', '2005-06-29 15:11:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1491918, 196453, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great use of sepia tones.</td>', 'Great use of sepia tones.', '2005-06-29 15:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491919, 197505, 20530, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I especially like how you captured the figure descending from the riggings. Good color choice too.</td>', 'Great shot. I especially like how you captured the figure descending from the riggings. Good color choice too.', '2005-06-29 15:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491920, 197249, 38492, '<td valign="top">overuse of sharpen has caused halo effect - especially noticable on the left edges that were in shadow. Good colour &amp; ok composition. Shifting the camera slightly to the left would have given you more negative space on the left, implying fading out, and wouldn''t have caused the person to stand out so much.</td>', 'overuse of sharpen has caused halo effect - especially noticable on the left edges that were in shadow. Good colour & ok composition. Shifting the camera slightly to the left would have given you more negative space on the left, implying fading out, and wouldn''t have caused the person to stand out so much.', '2005-06-29 15:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491921, 197573, 37719, '<td valign="top">I think it needs a new title - too long and not necessary.  Furnace would have been enough and to tell me it made canon balls is totally irrelevant.  It would have been stronger with different lighting - darker - to bring out more of the character of the stone.</td>', 'I think it needs a new title - too long and not necessary.  Furnace would have been enough and to tell me it made canon balls is totally irrelevant.  It would have been stronger with different lighting - darker - to bring out more of the character of the stone.', '2005-06-29 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491923, 197060, 37719, '<td valign="top">I like the grainy look - takes me back to watching NASA stuff on TV in the 60''s.</td>', 'I like the grainy look - takes me back to watching NASA stuff on TV in the 60''s.', '2005-06-29 15:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491925, 197053, 37719, '<td valign="top">Clever!</td>', 'Clever!', '2005-06-29 15:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491929, 194859, 20530, '<td valign="top">Nice tongue in cheek. Curious to see if everyone gets it. Otherwise, the sky may be too white and highlights overblown? I''m not an expert and I don''t know if I''m describing this properly.</td>', 'Nice tongue in cheek. Curious to see if everyone gets it. Otherwise, the sky may be too white and highlights overblown? I''m not an expert and I don''t know if I''m describing this properly.', '2005-06-29 15:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491934, 196352, 38492, '<td valign="top">sky is very overblown, and horizon isn''t quite level. I would also have cropped off the vety left edge to remove the few branches showing from the next tree along. I''d try this with a lower exposure, then using shadows/highlights or floodflash tool  to pull the foreground back in post processing.<br/></td>', 'sky is very overblown, and horizon isn''t quite level. I would also have cropped off the vety left edge to remove the few branches showing from the next tree along. I''d try this with a lower exposure, then using shadows/highlights or floodflash tool  to pull the foreground back in post processing.', '2005-06-29 15:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491935, 195674, 38492, '<td valign="top">The high exposure gives the illusion that the lights are still working! :)</td>', 'The high exposure gives the illusion that the lights are still working! :)', '2005-06-29 15:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491937, 197249, 20530, '<td valign="top">Castles are tough to shoot in bright light. I think with softer light, sharper focus and a closer crop, this would be a really nice image.</td>', 'Castles are tough to shoot in bright light. I think with softer light, sharper focus and a closer crop, this would be a really nice image.', '2005-06-29 15:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491938, 197515, 15266, '<td valign="top">I don''t get a real feeling of composition here, just a bunch of things shoved together.  Also, using fewer items would make them stand out better.</td>', 'I don''t get a real feeling of composition here, just a bunch of things shoved together.  Also, using fewer items would make them stand out better.', '2005-06-29 15:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491939, 197631, 20530, '<td valign="top">Like the humor and the colors. Interesting angle. Nice crop.</td>', 'Like the humor and the colors. Interesting angle. Nice crop.', '2005-06-29 15:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491941, 195476, 38492, '<td valign="top">very over exposed, and the horizon isn''t quite level.</td>', 'very over exposed, and the horizon isn''t quite level.', '2005-06-29 15:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491946, 196825, 38492, '<td valign="top">Great photo!</td>', 'Great photo!', '2005-06-29 15:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491947, 196749, 15266, '<td valign="top">The subject is rather dark and cut off.  Including the entire toy and using fill flash would have helped overall quality.  Also the door in the bg is distracting.</td>', 'The subject is rather dark and cut off.  Including the entire toy and using fill flash would have helped overall quality.  Also the door in the bg is distracting.', '2005-06-29 15:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491948, 197617, 37719, '<td valign="top">One of the few typewriters entered that i like.  Very clean shot, well focused and nice lighting.  Glad you didn''t use the whole thing in your shot.</td>', 'One of the few typewriters entered that i like.  Very clean shot, well focused and nice lighting.  Glad you didn''t use the whole thing in your shot.', '2005-06-29 15:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491949, 197628, 15266, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of motion,  well composed.</td>', 'Nice sense of motion,  well composed.', '2005-06-29 15:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491951, 196926, 37719, '<td valign="top">hey - did you kick out the birds to use this?  Nice shot.</td>', 'hey - did you kick out the birds to use this?  Nice shot.', '2005-06-29 15:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491952, 196149, 15266, '<td valign="top">Out of focus FG items is rarely a good choice.  It makes the entire picture seem OOF.  This shot (imo) would work better if FG items were in focus and short DOF used.</td>', 'Out of focus FG items is rarely a good choice.  It makes the entire picture seem OOF.  This shot (imo) would work better if FG items were in focus and short DOF used.', '2005-06-29 15:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491953, 196320, 38492, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. not exactly obsolete, though.</td>', 'Nice capture. not exactly obsolete, though.', '2005-06-29 15:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491955, 197635, 20530, '<td valign="top">Would like to see more detail on pump. The white post in background is distracting, and handle takes my eye out of picture.</td>', 'Would like to see more detail on pump. The white post in background is distracting, and handle takes my eye out of picture.', '2005-06-29 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491956, 197560, 15266, '<td valign="top">Everything is so similar in color, makes it hard to ''find'' the subject.  A slight increase in contrast would have helped.</td>', 'Everything is so similar in color, makes it hard to ''find'' the subject.  A slight increase in contrast would have helped.', '2005-06-29 15:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1491961, 196956, 15266, '<td valign="top">This image feels rather tightly cropped, more space around the lens would make a more interesting image.  Also the posting size is so small, its very hard to see the details.   (you can post as large as 640pix on longest side)</td>', 'This image feels rather tightly cropped, more space around the lens would make a more interesting image.  Also the posting size is so small, its very hard to see the details.   (you can post as large as 640pix on longest side)', '2005-06-29 15:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
