(1491979, 197343, 37719, '<td valign="top">When you spell your title incorrectly it makes me think you didn''t care enough about your shot to bother with getting the title correct.    I think it would have been stronger in the challenge if the perspective/angle of shot was different.</td>', 'When you spell your title incorrectly it makes me think you didn''t care enough about your shot to bother with getting the title correct.    I think it would have been stronger in the challenge if the perspective/angle of shot was different.', '2005-06-29 15:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
