(1492032, 197546, 15266, '<td valign="top">Hmmm  where to begin....   I like the idea here - however - execution...  The light is far too bright on the surface of the walkman and causes very dark shadows in the fg.  Using fill flash, or a 2nd light source would correct that.  Also, the wrinkled cloth gives the image a very rough and thrown together feel.  And one last thing, if your going to include the headphones in the shot, I think they should be included completely, not having the wire leave and reenter the image.    I hope you find this helpful.</td>', 'Hmmm  where to begin....   I like the idea here - however - execution...  The light is far too bright on the surface of the walkman and causes very dark shadows in the fg.  Using fill flash, or a 2nd light source would correct that.  Also, the wrinkled cloth gives the image a very rough and thrown together feel.  And one last thing, if your going to include the headphones in the shot, I think they should be included completely, not having the wire leave and reenter the image.    I hope you find this helpful.', '2005-06-29 15:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
