(1492344, 196832, 37893, '<td valign="top">Great idea. However, it probably would be better if the subject was to the right or left giving the ocean more view. This would really emphasize the solitude of this old lighthouse. Always remeber the rules of thirds for better composition. This gets a 7 from me for concept and idea.</td>', 'Great idea. However, it probably would be better if the subject was to the right or left giving the ocean more view. This would really emphasize the solitude of this old lighthouse. Always remeber the rules of thirds for better composition. This gets a 7 from me for concept and idea.', '2005-06-29 17:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1492347, 196096, 37444, '<td valign="top">It may be obsolete to you, but millions still use one.</td>', 'It may be obsolete to you, but millions still use one.', '2005-06-29 17:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
