(1492354, 196768, 37130, '<td valign="top">The depth of field would have made the flowers add a nice touch. The focus on the handle in the front is distracting. Certainly dirty and not been used recently.  As for obsolete, I have my doubts.</td>', 'The depth of field would have made the flowers add a nice touch. The focus on the handle in the front is distracting. Certainly dirty and not been used recently.  As for obsolete, I have my doubts.', '2005-06-29 17:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
