(1492378, 195163, 37130, '<td valign="top">The film, camera and technology is still in development. I fail to see the relationship to the challenge. However the glare in the front againt the dark object is to strong a contrast. The focus could have been better and perhaps a little bit of lighting on top of the camera would have helped.</td>', 'The film, camera and technology is still in development. I fail to see the relationship to the challenge. However the glare in the front againt the dark object is to strong a contrast. The focus could have been better and perhaps a little bit of lighting on top of the camera would have helped.', '2005-06-29 17:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
