(1493153, 196353, 37130, '<td valign="top">Endangered perhaps but obsolete, broken or even outdated certainly not in my opinion. However am open to being convinced prior to the end of voting. Otherwise the scene is wonderful but lacks depth of field. ---- I duly and respectfully will alter my vote, I will not punish someone for out of challenge without telling them and hearing their interpretation. I agree with your entry regarding obsolete. Now knowing that a 400mm lens was used it also changes certain things. I have requested that the ISO, Speed, Fstop, Lens etc be included in voting but have been turned down. Congrats a well deserved change from 1 to 7</td>', 'Endangered perhaps but obsolete, broken or even outdated certainly not in my opinion. However am open to being convinced prior to the end of voting. Otherwise the scene is wonderful but lacks depth of field. ---- I duly and respectfully will alter my vote, I will not punish someone for out of challenge without telling them and hearing their interpretation. I agree with your entry regarding obsolete. Now knowing that a 400mm lens was used it also changes certain things. I have requested that the ISO, Speed, Fstop, Lens etc be included in voting but have been turned down. Congrats a well deserved change from 1 to 7', '2005-06-29 20:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
