(1494967, 195584, 16648, '<td valign="top">Does not meet the challenge IMHO. I see a bible. Still the most popular book in the world. So i look to your title, and i understand the symbolism. I understand that in todays world technology has indeed made religion obsolete (no need to have a higher power to pray to to save us from the unexplained).  However, based on my observation of the people on this planet, religion is not obsolete. So do i vote based on my opinion or yours? I have to vote based on my opinion. Or else, i as a voter, become obsolete.<br/> <br/>As to the picture itself...technically acceptable, but a kind of stock shot - nothing unique or creative. Set the sucker on fire and we''ll have a moving image (for better or worse).</td>', 'Does not meet the challenge IMHO. I see a bible. Still the most popular book in the world. So i look to your title, and i understand the symbolism. I understand that in todays world technology has indeed made religion obsolete (no need to have a higher power to pray to to save us from the unexplained).  However, based on my observation of the people on this planet, religion is not obsolete. So do i vote based on my opinion or yours? I have to vote based on my opinion. Or else, i as a voter, become obsolete. As to the picture itself...technically acceptable, but a kind of stock shot - nothing unique or creative. Set the sucker on fire and we''ll have a moving image (for better or worse).', '2005-06-30 12:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
