(1495304, 197262, 39679, '<td valign="top">I normally whine about photographers using B&amp;W as it''s often done for no real reason.  However, I think you made a great choice using it here.  It really shows off the contrast between the lighted and shadowed sides of the mill.  I also really like your choice of perspective.  Great shot.</td>', 'I normally whine about photographers using B&W as it''s often done for no real reason.  However, I think you made a great choice using it here.  It really shows off the contrast between the lighted and shadowed sides of the mill.  I also really like your choice of perspective.  Great shot.', '2005-06-30 15:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495308, 197005, 29269, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. Technically, it could have been better (IMO) if you did not have that lens flare at the bottom, and if you did not blown up the sky (upper right) and the ground (lower right corner)<br/>Nice non-standart perspective. Another suggestion (although I am not sure what was to the right) would be to add more negative space to the right instead of cutting it off like this.</td>', 'Very nice photo. Technically, it could have been better (IMO) if you did not have that lens flare at the bottom, and if you did not blown up the sky (upper right) and the ground (lower right corner)Nice non-standart perspective. Another suggestion (although I am not sure what was to the right) would be to add more negative space to the right instead of cutting it off like this.', '2005-06-30 15:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
