(1495605, 196825, 8377, '<td valign="top">A beautiful camera shot! I think including a person in the photo really adds an extra bit of character to it that I like.</td>', 'A beautiful camera shot! I think including a person in the photo really adds an extra bit of character to it that I like.', '2005-06-30 17:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495606, 196999, 3669, '<td valign="top">The bridge covered in foliage is actually kind of pretty.  Picture looks kind of dull though.  Could use just a tad of contrast.</td>', 'The bridge covered in foliage is actually kind of pretty.  Picture looks kind of dull though.  Could use just a tad of contrast.', '2005-06-30 17:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495607, 197602, 34194, '<td valign="top">Nasty.</td>', 'Nasty.', '2005-06-30 17:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495608, 197275, 3669, '<td valign="top">The beach is very pretty.  I like the colors.  Your subject, though, is pretty far away.  Can''t see it very well.</td>', 'The beach is very pretty.  I like the colors.  Your subject, though, is pretty far away.  Can''t see it very well.', '2005-06-30 17:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495609, 195769, 8377, '<td valign="top">Very nice photograph. I like the colors in this, its a really unique image. My only suggestion would be to rotate the image a slight tad, to make the horizon straight.</td>', 'Very nice photograph. I like the colors in this, its a really unique image. My only suggestion would be to rotate the image a slight tad, to make the horizon straight.', '2005-06-30 17:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495617, 197588, 3669, '<td valign="top">USPS for personal use is becoming fairly obsolete, I guess.  Your picture appears to be a little overexposed in some areas.   I don''t really care for the yellow hue.  Plus the angle is a little weird.</td>', 'USPS for personal use is becoming fairly obsolete, I guess.  Your picture appears to be a little overexposed in some areas.   I don''t really care for the yellow hue.  Plus the angle is a little weird.', '2005-06-30 17:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495618, 195730, 8377, '<td valign="top">I actually really like this image. It has a very old feel to it, which helps the obsolete-ness of it. The multitude of dust is very nice as well.  Good vivid colors and great sharpness. No strings??? Now that sounds like a guitar I might be able to play.   ;)</td>', 'I actually really like this image. It has a very old feel to it, which helps the obsolete-ness of it. The multitude of dust is very nice as well.  Good vivid colors and great sharpness. No strings??? Now that sounds like a guitar I might be able to play.   ;)', '2005-06-30 17:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495622, 197080, 34194, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure of the use of infrared but interesting none the less.</td>', 'I''m not sure of the use of infrared but interesting none the less.', '2005-06-30 17:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495626, 196903, 39939, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and subject. Speaking of which, where did you dig up something like this?<br/>The subject is more original than other subjects that were published, which is why I personally gave those photographs of old camera equipment, typewriters and computers a low score. I hope you agree with my sentiment.<br/>Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Nice composition and subject. Speaking of which, where did you dig up something like this?The subject is more original than other subjects that were published, which is why I personally gave those photographs of old camera equipment, typewriters and computers a low score. I hope you agree with my sentiment.Keep up the good work.', '2005-06-30 17:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495627, 197583, 3669, '<td valign="top">Is this an old fire truck?  Interesting that tire chains were on it when it was parked and that they are on the front.  Anyway (LOL), definatly mets challenge IMO.  Picture well done.</td>', 'Is this an old fire truck?  Interesting that tire chains were on it when it was parked and that they are on the front.  Anyway (LOL), definatly mets challenge IMO.  Picture well done.', '2005-06-30 17:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495634, 197435, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed photo.  Focus just seems a tad soft.  Sepia tone is fitting here, but perhaps a little TOO yellow for my liking.  Otherwise, well done.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nicely framed photo.  Focus just seems a tad soft.  Sepia tone is fitting here, but perhaps a little TOO yellow for my liking.  Otherwise, well done.  Good luck.', '2005-06-30 17:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495641, 197640, 29269, '<td valign="top">A very nice collection of EU coins! It took me a second or two to realize that Euro had replaced all these...<br/>Nice lighting, good composition and nice DOF.  8.</td>', 'A very nice collection of EU coins! It took me a second or two to realize that Euro had replaced all these...Nice lighting, good composition and nice DOF.  8.', '2005-06-30 17:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495644, 195480, 39939, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, both the photograph and the mental one given through the title.<br/>Although the colours were somewhat sharper on the blue than the pink, it is very good.<br/>Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Lovely image, both the photograph and the mental one given through the title.Although the colours were somewhat sharper on the blue than the pink, it is very good.Keep up the good work.', '2005-06-30 17:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495649, 195515, 3669, '<td valign="top">Subject in this picture appears more to be the couple and not the windmill which, by the title, I take it was to be your obsolete object.   Wouldn''t have known it if for that.  BOOO  :-)  Weird angle, but nice couple.  Would like to see more of the woman''s face.</td>', 'Subject in this picture appears more to be the couple and not the windmill which, by the title, I take it was to be your obsolete object.   Wouldn''t have known it if for that.  BOOO  :-)  Weird angle, but nice couple.  Would like to see more of the woman''s face.', '2005-06-30 17:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495650, 196104, 29269, '<td valign="top">I think that you should have focused more on that crack in the door. This way it looks like a perfectly good washer sitting on the side of the road, just delivered on the pallete to someone''s home.</td>', 'I think that you should have focused more on that crack in the door. This way it looks like a perfectly good washer sitting on the side of the road, just delivered on the pallete to someone''s home.', '2005-06-30 17:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495659, 195676, 3669, '<td valign="top">i see the meaning in your picture.  The sleak new flatscreen in the limelight and the old dinosaur back in the shadows.  Perhaps you could acheive the same meaning by using less space.  Good idea though</td>', 'i see the meaning in your picture.  The sleak new flatscreen in the limelight and the old dinosaur back in the shadows.  Perhaps you could acheive the same meaning by using less space.  Good idea though', '2005-06-30 17:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495661, 195668, 3669, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflection in the water.  Obsolete subject kind of vague IMO.</td>', 'Beautiful reflection in the water.  Obsolete subject kind of vague IMO.', '2005-06-30 17:21:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1495665, 196143, 3669, '<td valign="top">BOOO!!  LOL  Interesting take on the challenge.</td>', 'BOOO!!  LOL  Interesting take on the challenge.', '2005-06-30 17:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495669, 194213, 38198, '<td valign="top">Why earth worms?????</td>', 'Why earth worms?????', '2005-06-30 17:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495674, 196782, 39830, '<td valign="top">Simple. Elegant. Perfectly captures the essence of the challenge topic. Well done!</td>', 'Simple. Elegant. Perfectly captures the essence of the challenge topic. Well done!', '2005-06-30 17:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495677, 197585, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great image and subject!  It seems a little OOF and overexposed, but those are small factors when compared to the overall impression.  Nice job!  7</td>', 'Great image and subject!  It seems a little OOF and overexposed, but those are small factors when compared to the overall impression.  Nice job!  7', '2005-06-30 17:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495679, 196270, 34659, '<td valign="top">Really nice treatment of a somewhat common theme in this challenge.  7</td>', 'Really nice treatment of a somewhat common theme in this challenge.  7', '2005-06-30 17:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495681, 197432, 34659, '<td valign="top">Really nice treatment of a somewhat common theme for this challenge.  7</td>', 'Really nice treatment of a somewhat common theme for this challenge.  7', '2005-06-30 17:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495683, 195517, 38198, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, photo but not obsolete</td>', 'Wonderful, photo but not obsolete', '2005-06-30 17:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495684, 195411, 34659, '<td valign="top">Really nice treatment of a somewhat common theme for this challenge.  I do think it the image appears a bit OOF and that the lighting (while sparse) may seem a bit harsh = contrast too high).  Still, a nice shot.  6</td>', 'Really nice treatment of a somewhat common theme for this challenge.  I do think it the image appears a bit OOF and that the lighting (while sparse) may seem a bit harsh = contrast too high).  Still, a nice shot.  6', '2005-06-30 17:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495685, 196818, 34659, '<td valign="top">Really unique treatment of a somewhat common theme for this challenge.  7</td>', 'Really unique treatment of a somewhat common theme for this challenge.  7', '2005-06-30 17:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495686, 197432, 32997, '<td valign="top">I love the way you have made the pump seem noble, through your composition. Wonderful tones, the sky is perfect for this shot. Excellent work!</td>', 'I love the way you have made the pump seem noble, through your composition. Wonderful tones, the sky is perfect for this shot. Excellent work!', '2005-06-30 17:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495687, 197545, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image and nice lighting.  I do think that it seems a bit overprocessed in the shadows at the bottom of the rock, but otherwise - great job!  7</td>', 'Beautiful image and nice lighting.  I do think that it seems a bit overprocessed in the shadows at the bottom of the rock, but otherwise - great job!  7', '2005-06-30 17:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495688, 197623, 39830, '<td valign="top">b/w was an excellent chioce for this photograph! Very well framed, and I like how you made the axle the lower boundary. Concrete block behind the cannon does glare some, so a slightly quicker shutter speed may have helped make it perfect. Overall a very nice pic.</td>', 'b/w was an excellent chioce for this photograph! Very well framed, and I like how you made the axle the lower boundary. Concrete block behind the cannon does glare some, so a slightly quicker shutter speed may have helped make it perfect. Overall a very nice pic.', '2005-06-30 17:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495689, 197249, 34659, '<td valign="top">Such a picturesque scene.  Really nice lighting (although maybe just a tad bright) and the detail on the castle is good, but the detail on the grasses seems lost.  Still, all in all a very good entry - I love the sky.  7</td>', 'Such a picturesque scene.  Really nice lighting (although maybe just a tad bright) and the detail on the castle is good, but the detail on the grasses seems lost.  Still, all in all a very good entry - I love the sky.  7', '2005-06-30 17:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495692, 197313, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great composition and leading lines from the equipment to the mountain (altho I know that''s a different challenge).  Nice colors too - I''d like to have seen a little sharper focus, but all in all a great image.  7</td>', 'Great composition and leading lines from the equipment to the mountain (altho I know that''s a different challenge).  Nice colors too - I''d like to have seen a little sharper focus, but all in all a great image.  7', '2005-06-30 17:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495693, 195777, 7743, '<td valign="top">The closeness of this image makes the stamp look like a cerated piece of metal.  Interesting idea.  The shallow DOF draws the eye directly to the corner of the stamp however the cancellation date draws the eye away so is a bit distracting.  Also, the part of the image that is in focus is either too narrow or to far from the bottom of the image.  I feel that there is too much out of focus in the bottom half of the image.  A slightly different perspective may have helped with the placement of the DOF. 6</td>', 'The closeness of this image makes the stamp look like a cerated piece of metal.  Interesting idea.  The shallow DOF draws the eye directly to the corner of the stamp however the cancellation date draws the eye away so is a bit distracting.  Also, the part of the image that is in focus is either too narrow or to far from the bottom of the image.  I feel that there is too much out of focus in the bottom half of the image.  A slightly different perspective may have helped with the placement of the DOF. 6', '2005-06-30 17:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495695, 197204, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice work of detail in foreground and blur in background, although I think the shot is overexposed overall and the sky is not very interesting (not that it''s your fault for the weather!).  :-)  Oddly enough, I think you have great detail, but it''s just not close enough to the front and the background could have much less.  I think too, that you could have offset the main subject a little - rather than being dead center.  Regardless, it''s a nice image and a strong entry.  6</td>', 'Nice work of detail in foreground and blur in background, although I think the shot is overexposed overall and the sky is not very interesting (not that it''s your fault for the weather!).  :-)  Oddly enough, I think you have great detail, but it''s just not close enough to the front and the background could have much less.  I think too, that you could have offset the main subject a little - rather than being dead center.  Regardless, it''s a nice image and a strong entry.  6', '2005-06-30 17:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495697, 196616, 32321, '<td valign="top">You need to check some of the threads/tutorials on how to upload a picture. This picture is way too small to score fairly.</td>', 'You need to check some of the threads/tutorials on how to upload a picture. This picture is way too small to score fairly.', '2005-06-30 17:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495700, 197422, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the idea however I feel that the composition is too static with the dividing line between the typewriter and the keyboard being right down the middle.  Having this dividing line on the diagonal I think would make the image more dynamic.<br/> <br/>The lighting is pretty sweet though there is one hot spot on the typewriter. 6</td>', 'I like the idea however I feel that the composition is too static with the dividing line between the typewriter and the keyboard being right down the middle.  Having this dividing line on the diagonal I think would make the image more dynamic. The lighting is pretty sweet though there is one hot spot on the typewriter. 6', '2005-06-30 17:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495703, 197581, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice take on a certainly antiquated (altho still used) method.  I used to use a metronome every day when practicing the piano throughout my childhood.  I like the colors and the overall composition, but the angle of the metronome is a little "off" to me and the blurred image of the pendulum is a bit of a distraction - might have been better to have one strong position highlighted.  Still, overall a very unique and strong entry in this challenge.  6</td>', 'Nice take on a certainly antiquated (altho still used) method.  I used to use a metronome every day when practicing the piano throughout my childhood.  I like the colors and the overall composition, but the angle of the metronome is a little "off" to me and the blurred image of the pendulum is a bit of a distraction - might have been better to have one strong position highlighted.  Still, overall a very unique and strong entry in this challenge.  6', '2005-06-30 17:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495706, 197355, 34659, '<td valign="top">These phones look exactly the same to me, and I can''t tell where you''re drawing the line of obselescence.  I like the juxtaposition, but would have liked to see you juxtapose opposites.  To me (as is) doesn''t really meet the challenge - sorry.  2</td>', 'These phones look exactly the same to me, and I can''t tell where you''re drawing the line of obselescence.  I like the juxtaposition, but would have liked to see you juxtapose opposites.  To me (as is) doesn''t really meet the challenge - sorry.  2', '2005-06-30 17:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495710, 196215, 20613, '<td valign="top">very beautiful, interesting photo.  the colors are so vivid, i''m reminded of a cartoon.  excellent.</td>', 'very beautiful, interesting photo.  the colors are so vivid, i''m reminded of a cartoon.  excellent.', '2005-06-30 17:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495711, 197018, 20613, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Very interesting &amp; amazing detail.  great subject.</td>', 'Wow.  Very interesting & amazing detail.  great subject.', '2005-06-30 17:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495712, 195708, 34659, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this shot seems OOF and off topic for the challenge (IMHO).  Perhaps you were drawing some reference from the topic, but I don''t see anything (especially with the title emphasizing the insect) that is broken, out of use, outdated, or obsolete.  1</td>', 'Sorry, but this shot seems OOF and off topic for the challenge (IMHO).  Perhaps you were drawing some reference from the topic, but I don''t see anything (especially with the title emphasizing the insect) that is broken, out of use, outdated, or obsolete.  1', '2005-06-30 17:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495718, 197176, 34659, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but the blurred image (although obviously taken of a rotary telephone) does not (IMHO) clearly represent anything meaningful (even with the title).  Yes, the challenge required "Take a picture of something that has outlived its usefulness. It could be old technology, broken, discarded, outgrown, forgotten - anything. Exception: people (alive or dead) are not to be the main subject.", but it''s difficult to distinguish any major subject or meaning from this photo (IMHO).  I understand that it is of a rotary telephone, but why not represent it more clearly?  1<br/></td>', 'Sorry, but the blurred image (although obviously taken of a rotary telephone) does not (IMHO) clearly represent anything meaningful (even with the title).  Yes, the challenge required "Take a picture of something that has outlived its usefulness. It could be old technology, broken, discarded, outgrown, forgotten - anything. Exception: people (alive or dead) are not to be the main subject.", but it''s difficult to distinguish any major subject or meaning from this photo (IMHO).  I understand that it is of a rotary telephone, but why not represent it more clearly?  1', '2005-06-30 17:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495735, 197593, 34659, '<td valign="top">While I understand that the challenge is to "Take a picture of something that has outlived its usefulness. It could be old technology, broken, discarded, outgrown, forgotten - anything. Exception: people (alive or dead) are not to be the main subject.", I am not really captured by this shot.  The left eye (right eye of the cat), while obviously manipulated to augment or simulate blindness, still doesn''t (IMHO) convey a strong sense of obselescence.<br/> <br/>The photo overall is also overexposed and too close to the subject to be a powerful close-up and too far from the subject to be a good macro.  I think I understand what you were trying to convey - blindness of a cat and the physical and visible implications of the lack of sight, but I just don''t think you achieved it in this particular image.<br/> <br/>I do think that the idea is really cool and a unique take on an overly saturated topic of wheels, trains, typewriters, floppy disks, LPs, cassettes, 8 tracks, cars, and abandoned buildings, but the idea isn''t enough if the actual content doesn''t convey what you''re trying to present.  I''m really disappointed that I couldn''t vote this higher due to the quality of the photo - as opposed to not meeting the challenge.  You''ve spent a lot of thought on the topic - that much is clear, but unfortunately, it didn''t translate to a uniquely superior image.  2</td>', 'While I understand that the challenge is to "Take a picture of something that has outlived its usefulness. It could be old technology, broken, discarded, outgrown, forgotten - anything. Exception: people (alive or dead) are not to be the main subject.", I am not really captured by this shot.  The left eye (right eye of the cat), while obviously manipulated to augment or simulate blindness, still doesn''t (IMHO) convey a strong sense of obselescence. The photo overall is also overexposed and too close to the subject to be a powerful close-up and too far from the subject to be a good macro.  I think I understand what you were trying to convey - blindness of a cat and the physical and visible implications of the lack of sight, but I just don''t think you achieved it in this particular image. I do think that the idea is really cool and a unique take on an overly saturated topic of wheels, trains, typewriters, floppy disks, LPs, cassettes, 8 tracks, cars, and abandoned buildings, but the idea isn''t enough if the actual content doesn''t convey what you''re trying to present.  I''m really disappointed that I couldn''t vote this higher due to the quality of the photo - as opposed to not meeting the challenge.  You''ve spent a lot of thought on the topic - that much is clear, but unfortunately, it didn''t translate to a uniquely superior image.  2', '2005-06-30 17:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495738, 197074, 39839, '<td valign="top">Really neat picture.  I think the bull walking away from the cart adds to it.</td>', 'Really neat picture.  I think the bull walking away from the cart adds to it.', '2005-06-30 18:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495740, 195941, 34659, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked closer and didn''t find much more than when I first saw it.  Sorry.  I''m sure that there is "something" there that I am missing, but I just don''t see it (and I''ve come back to this image more than 5 times).  I love the colors and beautiful lines of the smoke (I assume it''s smoke), but I still fail to grasp the relevance to the Obsolete Challenge.  I scored it as high as I did, because I think it''s a cool image - just not relevant (to me) to the current challenge.  3</td>', 'I''ve looked closer and didn''t find much more than when I first saw it.  Sorry.  I''m sure that there is "something" there that I am missing, but I just don''t see it (and I''ve come back to this image more than 5 times).  I love the colors and beautiful lines of the smoke (I assume it''s smoke), but I still fail to grasp the relevance to the Obsolete Challenge.  I scored it as high as I did, because I think it''s a cool image - just not relevant (to me) to the current challenge.  3', '2005-06-30 18:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495742, 195587, 39839, '<td valign="top">I understand what you were going for here, but I feel like it would have been much better in color.</td>', 'I understand what you were going for here, but I feel like it would have been much better in color.', '2005-06-30 18:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1495744, 196448, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful job.  Very nice.  In my humble opinion, this should be the clear winner of the blue ribbon.  I''ve reviewed all of the entries (twice now) and found yours to be the most relevant and unique.  10</td>', 'Beautiful job.  Very nice.  In my humble opinion, this should be the clear winner of the blue ribbon.  I''ve reviewed all of the entries (twice now) and found yours to be the most relevant and unique.  10', '2005-06-30 18:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
