(1495782, 195939, 34659, '<td valign="top">I bet you get a lot of comments on this image!  It''s a very cool and unique shot.  There''s good clarity of the main subjects, but they seem a little overprocessed to my eye ( they look like they''ve been removed from the shot, augmented, and then replaced with the updated images.  Whether or not this is the case, you have created a very emotional shot - which is great!  The more emotional reactions you receive from your audience the better (at least that''s my opinion).</td>', 'I bet you get a lot of comments on this image!  It''s a very cool and unique shot.  There''s good clarity of the main subjects, but they seem a little overprocessed to my eye ( they look like they''ve been removed from the shot, augmented, and then replaced with the updated images.  Whether or not this is the case, you have created a very emotional shot - which is great!  The more emotional reactions you receive from your audience the better (at least that''s my opinion).', '2005-06-30 18:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
