(1495988, 197190, 5354, '<td valign="top">OK so the ropes meet the challenge, I will admit that, but the image is so dreary. No play with lighting, no story, no action, nothing except a bit of rope on a wall.<br/>I do wish people would not just think of the challenge title, but would put some thought into producing something which is pleasing to look at too.</td>', 'OK so the ropes meet the challenge, I will admit that, but the image is so dreary. No play with lighting, no story, no action, nothing except a bit of rope on a wall.I do wish people would not just think of the challenge title, but would put some thought into producing something which is pleasing to look at too.', '2005-06-30 19:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
