(1496096, 197053, 3669, '<td valign="top">I''m probably a little dense as to the meaning you are portraying with this picture in relation to the title.   In any event, regardless of the meaning, this picture is well done.  The nuturing family in the light with the yuppie couple in the shadow.  Did you mean to emphasis the chest and pelvic areas of the couple?  Technically, the picture is good.  Too bad in this challenge you couldn''t clone out the white specks at the bottom left.  8</td>', 'I''m probably a little dense as to the meaning you are portraying with this picture in relation to the title.   In any event, regardless of the meaning, this picture is well done.  The nuturing family in the light with the yuppie couple in the shadow.  Did you mean to emphasis the chest and pelvic areas of the couple?  Technically, the picture is good.  Too bad in this challenge you couldn''t clone out the white specks at the bottom left.  8', '2005-06-30 20:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
