(1496102, 197506, 3669, '<td valign="top">The flag and the vintage sewing machine make for a nice picture.  It is well done.  In this challenge however with obsolete being the subject matter, I would think putting the focus on the sewing machine to be more appropriate.  Surly, the American flag is not obsolete.  Putting the challege aside, though, I really like this picture.  Singer being American made makes for a very patriotic theme as we are approaching July 4th.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The flag and the vintage sewing machine make for a nice picture.  It is well done.  In this challenge however with obsolete being the subject matter, I would think putting the focus on the sewing machine to be more appropriate.  Surly, the American flag is not obsolete.  Putting the challege aside, though, I really like this picture.  Singer being American made makes for a very patriotic theme as we are approaching July 4th.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-06-30 20:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496105, 195706, 39939, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between the old and the new, it really emphasises the subject of the challenge.<br/>However, more of the left side could have safely been cropped without destroying the symmetry of the image. Just a little bit, mind you.<br/>Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Nice contrast between the old and the new, it really emphasises the subject of the challenge.However, more of the left side could have safely been cropped without destroying the symmetry of the image. Just a little bit, mind you.Keep up the good work.', '2005-06-30 20:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496109, 197432, 3669, '<td valign="top">Lighting is nice.  The sky is beautiful in contrast to the ugly rusty old gas pump.  I think it would have been nicer to leave out the pipe on the left to concentrate more on the pump...perhaps getting a little closer to see the old number display.</td>', 'Lighting is nice.  The sky is beautiful in contrast to the ugly rusty old gas pump.  I think it would have been nicer to leave out the pipe on the left to concentrate more on the pump...perhaps getting a little closer to see the old number display.', '2005-06-30 20:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496113, 197270, 3669, '<td valign="top">Hey...even if its obsolete, I still play mine.  Just can''t get new games for it.  Nice DOF and angle for kind of a boring shot.  Don''t think I like the orange background though.  Kind of out of place.  7</td>', 'Hey...even if its obsolete, I still play mine.  Just can''t get new games for it.  Nice DOF and angle for kind of a boring shot.  Don''t think I like the orange background though.  Kind of out of place.  7', '2005-06-30 20:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496117, 196193, 39939, '<td valign="top">This really looks like it belongs on the cover of an old spy novel about WWII, if not for the headlines on the newspaper. For some reason, I am reminded of the novel; "Heart of the matter", although that could be the glass and the content of it.<br/>The composition and symmetry of the image is very well arranged, although I don''t want to know where you got hold of a pistol (even if it looks somewhat fake, I am sure it is only the lighting ... plastic would have been more glossy) this is a very good image.<br/>Keep up the good work.</td>', 'This really looks like it belongs on the cover of an old spy novel about WWII, if not for the headlines on the newspaper. For some reason, I am reminded of the novel; "Heart of the matter", although that could be the glass and the content of it.The composition and symmetry of the image is very well arranged, although I don''t want to know where you got hold of a pistol (even if it looks somewhat fake, I am sure it is only the lighting ... plastic would have been more glossy) this is a very good image.Keep up the good work.', '2005-06-30 20:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496118, 197137, 38925, '<td valign="top">good one, nice idea</td>', 'good one, nice idea', '2005-06-30 20:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496120, 196295, 3669, '<td valign="top">There has been so many old car photos that I''m getting tired of commenting on all of them.  This one is like the others...good but not great.  A little washed out especially at the top right.  Interesting angle...better than just a full body frontal shot as some have been.  Good luck in the challenge.  5</td>', 'There has been so many old car photos that I''m getting tired of commenting on all of them.  This one is like the others...good but not great.  A little washed out especially at the top right.  Interesting angle...better than just a full body frontal shot as some have been.  Good luck in the challenge.  5', '2005-06-30 20:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1496130, 197555, 3669, '<td valign="top">How''s fat and happy.   I think a more flattering shot of him would be from the side.  Although it looks like he needs grooming, I do believe that he is smiling for the camera.  I hope he doesn''t know you are considering him obsolete.</td>', 'How''s fat and happy.   I think a more flattering shot of him would be from the side.  Although it looks like he needs grooming, I do believe that he is smiling for the camera.  I hope he doesn''t know you are considering him obsolete.', '2005-06-30 20:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
