(1497085, 197310, 35602, '<td valign="top">All lines lead to the train.  Nice composition.  The only thing that might have improved the picture is doing it in landscape format rather than portraiit.  The train is too compressed in the image.  By the way, I''ve found that because of our editiing ability, all photos don''t even have to be a traditional rectangle.  They can be square as well.</td>', 'All lines lead to the train.  Nice composition.  The only thing that might have improved the picture is doing it in landscape format rather than portraiit.  The train is too compressed in the image.  By the way, I''ve found that because of our editiing ability, all photos don''t even have to be a traditional rectangle.  They can be square as well.', '2005-07-01 09:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497086, 197414, 36429, '<td valign="top">Nice colours. Looks like it was in the ocean? I cannot make out the obsolete object, and rust in itself is not obsolete, so I cannot vote it as high as I''d like to. Still a nice shot.</td>', 'Nice colours. Looks like it was in the ocean? I cannot make out the obsolete object, and rust in itself is not obsolete, so I cannot vote it as high as I''d like to. Still a nice shot.', '2005-07-01 09:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
