(1497802, 196832, 39571, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but everything is bullsy eyed - the horizon and the lighthouse. I would suggest placing the lighthouse on the left of the frame - in the ''dark'' - away from the light the sun is casting.  A few steps to the left (assuming you could move left) would of greatly improved the composition of this photo. Also, crop some off the bottom so the horizon is not so centered.</td>', 'Nice idea, but everything is bullsy eyed - the horizon and the lighthouse. I would suggest placing the lighthouse on the left of the frame - in the ''dark'' - away from the light the sun is casting.  A few steps to the left (assuming you could move left) would of greatly improved the composition of this photo. Also, crop some off the bottom so the horizon is not so centered.', '2005-07-01 16:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497803, 197573, 21422, '<td valign="top">Lighting is tough in this shot with the trees casting a shadow, however the highlights on the ground near the front are completely blown out. 4</td>', 'Lighting is tough in this shot with the trees casting a shadow, however the highlights on the ground near the front are completely blown out. 4', '2005-07-01 16:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497804, 195848, 21422, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The box that you have them sitting in causes some problems for the shot.  The reflection on the back wall is distracting and the box itself is distracting.  The color is good though.  5</td>', 'Nice idea.  The box that you have them sitting in causes some problems for the shot.  The reflection on the back wall is distracting and the box itself is distracting.  The color is good though.  5', '2005-07-01 16:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497806, 196143, 38734, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites :) Thank u, thank u :))) a 9 because.. I don''t know!!! &lt;=) I cant find  a 10 in this challenge, but your photo with the title is just GREAT  :) cant wait to c ur other photos!</td>', 'One of my favourites :) Thank u, thank u :))) a 9 because.. I don''t know!!! <=) I cant find  a 10 in this challenge, but your photo with the title is just GREAT  :) cant wait to c ur other photos!', '2005-07-01 16:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497807, 194732, 21422, '<td valign="top">Would have loved to see this shot with a tighter crop.  Nice shot over all though.  The lighting and colors are right on.</td>', 'Would have loved to see this shot with a tighter crop.  Nice shot over all though.  The lighting and colors are right on.', '2005-07-01 16:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497809, 197312, 21422, '<td valign="top">This shot seems to contain a lot of noise which I do not belive works in this shot. 5</td>', 'This shot seems to contain a lot of noise which I do not belive works in this shot. 5', '2005-07-01 16:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497810, 197548, 38734, '<td valign="top">it''s a good picture. Nothing too special,  but it''s one of my 3 9''s. Just good. Nice to c.</td>', 'it''s a good picture. Nothing too special,  but it''s one of my 3 9''s. Just good. Nice to c.', '2005-07-01 16:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497811, 197534, 21422, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and good choice of light placement.  The light shining through the holes is a great idea. 8</td>', 'Nice shot and good choice of light placement.  The light shining through the holes is a great idea. 8', '2005-07-01 16:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497812, 196637, 24512, '<td valign="top">Nice compostion, something about it gives me vertigo for some reason though, (not that its a bad thing)  I like the choice of B&amp;W for this one.  One thing that might have made it more appealing for me is the removal of the seat on the ground from the picture entirely, although one could really start looking for something and come up with some symbolic meaning for the seat being on the ground maybe in combination with the vegation starting to overtake the chair reclaiming borrowed natural resources.</td>', 'Nice compostion, something about it gives me vertigo for some reason though, (not that its a bad thing)  I like the choice of B&W for this one.  One thing that might have made it more appealing for me is the removal of the seat on the ground from the picture entirely, although one could really start looking for something and come up with some symbolic meaning for the seat being on the ground maybe in combination with the vegation starting to overtake the chair reclaiming borrowed natural resources.', '2005-07-01 16:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497814, 197640, 37961, '<td valign="top">The fact that you stood them up on their ends helps with this photograph. But it is still lacking in something, perhaps backlight or shine.</td>', 'The fact that you stood them up on their ends helps with this photograph. But it is still lacking in something, perhaps backlight or shine.', '2005-07-01 16:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497815, 197588, 38734, '<td valign="top">Love the colors. But the composition is confusing is a not-too-good way.. clumpsy. But again :) Good colors. 7</td>', 'Love the colors. But the composition is confusing is a not-too-good way.. clumpsy. But again :) Good colors. 7', '2005-07-01 16:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497816, 196226, 39571, '<td valign="top">nice idea!</td>', 'nice idea!', '2005-07-01 16:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497818, 197290, 21422, '<td valign="top">This shot has a lot of noise in it which does not work for this shot.  I do not see the need to bump up the ISO when it appears that it was a bright sunny day.  Not sure what is happening on the left side of the shot also. 3</td>', 'This shot has a lot of noise in it which does not work for this shot.  I do not see the need to bump up the ISO when it appears that it was a bright sunny day.  Not sure what is happening on the left side of the shot also. 3', '2005-07-01 16:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497822, 196320, 37961, '<td valign="top">While I in no way believe that Christianity is obsolete, I do like the photo as it is well lit and looks sincere. Nice.</td>', 'While I in no way believe that Christianity is obsolete, I do like the photo as it is well lit and looks sincere. Nice.', '2005-07-01 16:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497825, 197206, 37961, '<td valign="top">Gotta love the vintage Canon. But I think the photo for this challenge would have had more impact if you would have had a new Canon in view in the same photo.</td>', 'Gotta love the vintage Canon. But I think the photo for this challenge would have had more impact if you would have had a new Canon in view in the same photo.', '2005-07-01 16:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497827, 197275, 37539, '<td valign="top">Can''t really see the castle for the beach</td>', 'Can''t really see the castle for the beach', '2005-07-01 16:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497836, 194334, 39571, '<td valign="top">great subject. The large branch going accross the top of the frame is a bit distracting.  Try cropping it in a bit on the top and the left edge.</td>', 'great subject. The large branch going accross the top of the frame is a bit distracting.  Try cropping it in a bit on the top and the left edge.', '2005-07-01 17:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497837, 196103, 37961, '<td valign="top">Oh man, this looks like the old electric chairs. Where is the dialer on this thing? Must of been back in the operator daze. Certainly obsolete. Its good.</td>', 'Oh man, this looks like the old electric chairs. Where is the dialer on this thing? Must of been back in the operator daze. Certainly obsolete. Its good.', '2005-07-01 17:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497840, 197432, 37961, '<td valign="top">I love the light on this one. Great focus and composition. Must of used a polarizing filter.  Top 3 in the challenge I hope, and my personal favorite of the challenge! (10)</td>', 'I love the light on this one. Great focus and composition. Must of used a polarizing filter.  Top 3 in the challenge I hope, and my personal favorite of the challenge! (10)', '2005-07-01 17:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497841, 196215, 39571, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but next time try some fill flash on the foreground to bring out your main subject, as I find my eyes are drawn to the bright hillside away from your main subject.</td>', 'nice idea, but next time try some fill flash on the foreground to bring out your main subject, as I find my eyes are drawn to the bright hillside away from your main subject.', '2005-07-01 17:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497843, 196143, 38492, '<td valign="top">what is it with forks?! Well, there''s no use for it now.... Good shot &amp; interesting idea.</td>', 'what is it with forks?! Well, there''s no use for it now.... Good shot & interesting idea.', '2005-07-01 17:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497844, 196226, 37961, '<td valign="top">ok, im guessing Joey Lawrence or grigrigirl on this one. Very good lighting, but the filters on this look a little suspicious for basic editing.</td>', 'ok, im guessing Joey Lawrence or grigrigirl on this one. Very good lighting, but the filters on this look a little suspicious for basic editing.', '2005-07-01 17:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497845, 196218, 39088, '<td valign="top">Too small of a picture to see the detail.  I am new to this site and have just entered my first pic.  I read the tutorial under the learn link and it showed me how to get the largest and most clear pic and still fit in the confines of the contest.  More than likely everyone else is going to say this as well, but hopefully this is helpfull.  Looks like a great shot though just needs to be a little bigger.</td>', 'Too small of a picture to see the detail.  I am new to this site and have just entered my first pic.  I read the tutorial under the learn link and it showed me how to get the largest and most clear pic and still fit in the confines of the contest.  More than likely everyone else is going to say this as well, but hopefully this is helpfull.  Looks like a great shot though just needs to be a little bigger.', '2005-07-01 17:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497846, 196899, 38492, '<td valign="top">Some of us still use real ink pens - there''s nothing like the feel of a proper nib drawing out all those curlicues :) Nice shot, though.</td>', 'Some of us still use real ink pens - there''s nothing like the feel of a proper nib drawing out all those curlicues :) Nice shot, though.', '2005-07-01 17:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497847, 196759, 37961, '<td valign="top">This happened to be the first 35mm camera I ever owned. Me and my brother got them for christmas as teenagers. It took some really good photos. I like the light coming thru the back to the lense. Not sure what the object is in the rear of the photo, its a tad distracting. But since its a Canon.....ill overlook it. LOL</td>', 'This happened to be the first 35mm camera I ever owned. Me and my brother got them for christmas as teenagers. It took some really good photos. I like the light coming thru the back to the lense. Not sure what the object is in the rear of the photo, its a tad distracting. But since its a Canon.....ill overlook it. LOL', '2005-07-01 17:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497850, 195517, 38734, '<td valign="top">er... outstanding :) Considering the othernsubmissions :) But a lil boring... anyway, 8 :)</td>', 'er... outstanding :) Considering the othernsubmissions :) But a lil boring... anyway, 8 :)', '2005-07-01 17:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497851, 197560, 38492, '<td valign="top">Very low tone for a B&amp;W. Odd composition - the eye is drawn to the wheel hub, which is slightly off-centre - good, but the line of the car is cutting the middle of the photo, which is distracting - upper or lower third would have been better.</td>', 'Very low tone for a B&W. Odd composition - the eye is drawn to the wheel hub, which is slightly off-centre - good, but the line of the car is cutting the middle of the photo, which is distracting - upper or lower third would have been better.', '2005-07-01 17:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497854, 195681, 38492, '<td valign="top">Nice colours. There''s a few spots of sunshine on the wheel and leaves - a shot slightly later in the day might have given you more interesting light!</td>', 'Nice colours. There''s a few spots of sunshine on the wheel and leaves - a shot slightly later in the day might have given you more interesting light!', '2005-07-01 17:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497860, 197590, 29148, '<td valign="top">Hard to see the details of this wonderful old machine. Lighting needs improvement.</td>', 'Hard to see the details of this wonderful old machine. Lighting needs improvement.', '2005-07-01 17:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497861, 197600, 38492, '<td valign="top">Great composition! I really like the lighting here. The half open window gives a good contrast to the verticals, as does the mop. There''s a slight fringing on the left of the door frame, but it doesn''t detract from the photo.</td>', 'Great composition! I really like the lighting here. The half open window gives a good contrast to the verticals, as does the mop. There''s a slight fringing on the left of the door frame, but it doesn''t detract from the photo.', '2005-07-01 17:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497862, 197253, 29148, '<td valign="top">Good clean shot. The old photos make the picture</td>', 'Good clean shot. The old photos make the picture', '2005-07-01 17:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497864, 197500, 39571, '<td valign="top">very nice. I would suggest next time to try for a different point of view so you dont have a tree growing out of the top of the brick dome.</td>', 'very nice. I would suggest next time to try for a different point of view so you dont have a tree growing out of the top of the brick dome.', '2005-07-01 17:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497871, 195515, 38492, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, my eye''s not exactly focussing on the old windmill, I''m being distracted by something else! A change of DoF into the background would have met the challenge &lt;g&gt;</td>', 'Hmmm, my eye''s not exactly focussing on the old windmill, I''m being distracted by something else! A change of DoF into the background would have met the challenge <g>', '2005-07-01 17:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497876, 196929, 39571, '<td valign="top">wonderful point of view!</td>', 'wonderful point of view!', '2005-07-01 17:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497885, 197067, 38492, '<td valign="top">what are the speckles on your background? They''re slightly distracting, as is the hole in the lower cheque. Swapping them over might have helped.</td>', 'what are the speckles on your background? They''re slightly distracting, as is the hole in the lower cheque. Swapping them over might have helped.', '2005-07-01 17:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497890, 196919, 5015, '<td valign="top">very pretty</td>', 'very pretty', '2005-07-01 17:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497891, 194737, 38492, '<td valign="top">Blown out highlights spoil this.</td>', 'Blown out highlights spoil this.', '2005-07-01 17:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497892, 197587, 39098, '<td valign="top">i really like this picture, but whatever is on that plate is awfully scary looking. if anything the fork doesn''t look like it was places very well. the lighting could of been better too.</td>', 'i really like this picture, but whatever is on that plate is awfully scary looking. if anything the fork doesn''t look like it was places very well. the lighting could of been better too.', '2005-07-01 17:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497903, 197057, 38492, '<td valign="top">Overexposure spoils this - more detail would have made this more interesting. There''s no strong focal point here - perhaps a wider angle would have given more interest.</td>', 'Overexposure spoils this - more detail would have made this more interesting. There''s no strong focal point here - perhaps a wider angle would have given more interest.', '2005-07-01 17:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1497905, 197389, 12327, '<td valign="top">I like it... it seems like the house is really leaning since the trees look straight vertically.  The color is good too.</td>', 'I like it... it seems like the house is really leaning since the trees look straight vertically.  The color is good too.', '2005-07-01 17:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
