(1497985, 196820, 12327, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and composition, but I think the background is a bit distracting.  This might look good in with a black velvet background.<br/></td>', 'I like the subject and composition, but I think the background is a bit distracting.  This might look good in with a black velvet background.', '2005-07-01 18:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
