(1498515, 195802, 37539, '<td valign="top">My kids loved this shot.  ''Punch bug''  It''s fun, creative and shot from a nice angle.  The title adds the an extra bit of finesse.  Nice job.</td>', 'My kids loved this shot.  ''Punch bug''  It''s fun, creative and shot from a nice angle.  The title adds the an extra bit of finesse.  Nice job.', '2005-07-01 22:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
