(1498522, 196954, 37539, '<td valign="top">This has a nice soft feel to it.  Good lighting, nice composition.  It makes me think of the Quakers or the Amish.  It''s a refreshing take on the ''obsolete'' photos.</td>', 'This has a nice soft feel to it.  Good lighting, nice composition.  It makes me think of the Quakers or the Amish.  It''s a refreshing take on the ''obsolete'' photos.', '2005-07-01 23:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498526, 196353, 37539, '<td valign="top">I admit that at first I scored this lower because I didn''t see how it fits the challenge, but I love the picture anyway and have bumped up my score.  What a great wild west feel.</td>', 'I admit that at first I scored this lower because I didn''t see how it fits the challenge, but I love the picture anyway and have bumped up my score.  What a great wild west feel.', '2005-07-01 23:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498531, 197199, 37539, '<td valign="top">This shot evokes an emotion of forgotten childhood. I like that the picture makes you think less about obsolete and more about how the doll got there, who does it belong to, etc.  I like the coloring and lighting too.</td>', 'This shot evokes an emotion of forgotten childhood. I like that the picture makes you think less about obsolete and more about how the doll got there, who does it belong to, etc.  I like the coloring and lighting too.', '2005-07-01 23:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498537, 196926, 37539, '<td valign="top">I like the bird''s nest, but for such a natural object, the photo feels too staged.  It might have been more interesting if were in the context of a discarded background, like on the ground or something.  (Hope you don''t mind a constructive comment.)</td>', 'I like the bird''s nest, but for such a natural object, the photo feels too staged.  It might have been more interesting if were in the context of a discarded background, like on the ground or something.  (Hope you don''t mind a constructive comment.)', '2005-07-01 23:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498541, 196929, 37539, '<td valign="top">I''m torn on this one.  The right side of the image is so crisp and the left side is so blurred that the photo feels a bit disjointed.  Wish I could suggest something helpful, but I''m still learning myself.</td>', 'I''m torn on this one.  The right side of the image is so crisp and the left side is so blurred that the photo feels a bit disjointed.  Wish I could suggest something helpful, but I''m still learning myself.', '2005-07-01 23:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
