(1498551, 195848, 15711, '<td valign="top">Something very appealing about this to me.  I don''t know if it''s the three objects, their placement or what. I''ve come back to it several times. I wish you didn''t have the brackets visible for the shelf box, but then it wouldn''t be possible at all.  Nice colors - not overdone.</td>', 'Something very appealing about this to me.  I don''t know if it''s the three objects, their placement or what. I''ve come back to it several times. I wish you didn''t have the brackets visible for the shelf box, but then it wouldn''t be possible at all.  Nice colors - not overdone.', '2005-07-01 23:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498554, 194850, 37539, '<td valign="top">This photo is so digitized that it looks more like poor resolution than perhaps the grainy effect you may have intended.</td>', 'This photo is so digitized that it looks more like poor resolution than perhaps the grainy effect you may have intended.', '2005-07-01 23:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
