(1498698, 196639, 37858, '<td valign="top">I imagined the setting sun as an apt metaphor for the end of this motoring era.  Same with the tree stump (I bet the tree was still standing when this pump was active).  Lots of nostalgia in this shot.  Terrific composition.  A little bit of Norman Rockwell in this one, I think.  This photo not only captures the obsolete pump, but an entire obsolete time.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I imagined the setting sun as an apt metaphor for the end of this motoring era.  Same with the tree stump (I bet the tree was still standing when this pump was active).  Lots of nostalgia in this shot.  Terrific composition.  A little bit of Norman Rockwell in this one, I think.  This photo not only captures the obsolete pump, but an entire obsolete time.  Nicely done.', '2005-07-02 00:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498703, 197275, 37858, '<td valign="top">Nice clean lines.  Almost minimalist.</td>', 'Nice clean lines.  Almost minimalist.', '2005-07-02 00:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498705, 196448, 29269, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a powerful image. I know that it may suffer from the challenge topic ambiguity, but I''d really like to see it in top 10. And the horizon is perfectly OK, it does not need straightening.</td>', 'Wow, what a powerful image. I know that it may suffer from the challenge topic ambiguity, but I''d really like to see it in top 10. And the horizon is perfectly OK, it does not need straightening.', '2005-07-02 00:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498710, 197506, 37858, '<td valign="top">Nice use of symbols to carry out your concept of "obsolete".  Photo looks a bit out of focus on the machine.  Given the symbolism of Singer I am not sure that adds to the shot.  Overall, though, I gave you high marks.</td>', 'Nice use of symbols to carry out your concept of "obsolete".  Photo looks a bit out of focus on the machine.  Given the symbolism of Singer I am not sure that adds to the shot.  Overall, though, I gave you high marks.', '2005-07-02 00:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498724, 197032, 29904, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Just tossed this exact model from gandpa''s house!  Same wear pattern and all!     A little noisy.  Great angle.  It would top it off to have the old TV in the back ground!  :)  good luck</td>', 'LOL!  Just tossed this exact model from gandpa''s house!  Same wear pattern and all!     A little noisy.  Great angle.  It would top it off to have the old TV in the back ground!  :)  good luck', '2005-07-02 00:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498737, 194801, 29904, '<td valign="top">I read some forums on this challenge that began with "please not tons of old film cameras and film!"  I agree in part, but still this is very creatively lit.  Only change I would make is to crop just a little less.  It seems a little cut off and boxed in.  Otherwise Nice!</td>', 'I read some forums on this challenge that began with "please not tons of old film cameras and film!"  I agree in part, but still this is very creatively lit.  Only change I would make is to crop just a little less.  It seems a little cut off and boxed in.  Otherwise Nice!', '2005-07-02 01:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498742, 196759, 30822, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. But the light on the top of camera is distracting and blowing out part of the prism, could also use a little more contrast IMHO.</td>', 'Interesting concept. But the light on the top of camera is distracting and blowing out part of the prism, could also use a little more contrast IMHO.', '2005-07-02 01:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498744, 197176, 30822, '<td valign="top">I just don''t get it, I''m sorry.</td>', 'I just don''t get it, I''m sorry.', '2005-07-02 01:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498747, 195067, 30822, '<td valign="top">Technically well done. But they still sell film, I still use my grandfathers old Crown Graphic from 1930''s for landscape work and it''s way older than this. 5.</td>', 'Technically well done. But they still sell film, I still use my grandfathers old Crown Graphic from 1930''s for landscape work and it''s way older than this. 5.', '2005-07-02 01:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498755, 197337, 30822, '<td valign="top">What''swith the fruit in this image? I don''t get it, sorry. Also lighting and background just don''t work for me.  Maybe a closeup of the front of the camera would have worked better IMHO.</td>', 'What''swith the fruit in this image? I don''t get it, sorry. Also lighting and background just don''t work for me.  Maybe a closeup of the front of the camera would have worked better IMHO.', '2005-07-02 01:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498761, 195515, 30822, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure. The windmill is not really the main subject in this picture, the 2 people in forground are. Very good shot of them, except I would have tried to have more of the ladies face in it. Just my opinon though. Bumped you from a 3 to a 5 on this second look thru.</td>', 'Nice exposure. The windmill is not really the main subject in this picture, the 2 people in forground are. Very good shot of them, except I would have tried to have more of the ladies face in it. Just my opinon though. Bumped you from a 3 to a 5 on this second look thru.', '2005-07-02 01:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498762, 197407, 29904, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen soooo many of these shots today Yawn!  But, this one is very nicely done.  Great depth of field, that really grabs your attention that the red banged up tub is so sharply in focus.  Lovely foreground and back.  Nice composition and balance of shapes and textures.  Thanks for showing us how it''s done. :)</td>', 'I''ve seen soooo many of these shots today Yawn!  But, this one is very nicely done.  Great depth of field, that really grabs your attention that the red banged up tub is so sharply in focus.  Lovely foreground and back.  Nice composition and balance of shapes and textures.  Thanks for showing us how it''s done. :)', '2005-07-02 01:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498766, 196005, 30822, '<td valign="top">IMHO the lighting is really flat and the background is very distracting. Possibly try a solid background next time.</td>', 'IMHO the lighting is really flat and the background is very distracting. Possibly try a solid background next time.', '2005-07-02 01:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498771, 197069, 29904, '<td valign="top">Diffused light like from candles would have given this more authenticness.  Interesting subjects!</td>', 'Diffused light like from candles would have given this more authenticness.  Interesting subjects!', '2005-07-02 01:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
