(1498902, 195517, 18197, '<td valign="top">This feels washed out to me. I would suggest lowering the brightness and increasing the contrast. I think you''ll like it better. I know I would. It is probably because the photo was taken mid day with bright sun. Try to shoot earlier or later in the day or try a polarizing filter if you can''t.</td>', 'This feels washed out to me. I would suggest lowering the brightness and increasing the contrast. I think you''ll like it better. I know I would. It is probably because the photo was taken mid day with bright sun. Try to shoot earlier or later in the day or try a polarizing filter if you can''t.', '2005-07-02 02:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1498903, 196903, 1993, '<td valign="top">I like the balance of space in this photo.  Sorry about your neighbor.</td>', 'I like the balance of space in this photo.  Sorry about your neighbor.', '2005-07-02 02:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
