(1499020, 197506, 6804, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm.  I love the picture.  I love the bright colors.  My only suggestion for improving this shot to my liking would be eliminating the soft focus on the main subject.  I think too much attention is being pulled from the "obsolete" subject and drawn into the bright colors of the flag.  The picture as a stand-alone shot (without the challenge theme)  is much better just as you have it.  9</td>', 'Hmmmm.  I love the picture.  I love the bright colors.  My only suggestion for improving this shot to my liking would be eliminating the soft focus on the main subject.  I think too much attention is being pulled from the "obsolete" subject and drawn into the bright colors of the flag.  The picture as a stand-alone shot (without the challenge theme)  is much better just as you have it.  9', '2005-07-02 02:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
