(1499053, 196974, 6804, '<td valign="top">OK....where''d you find this one?  I love it.   I''d love to play with this one a bit.  I''d probably give it a little more contrast in the midtones and I might play with the crop a little.  You could crop at the first window on the right and land the pump in a stronger visual position using the grass as leadlines from the corner..   Beautiful composition.  This is my kind of picture.</td>', 'OK....where''d you find this one?  I love it.   I''d love to play with this one a bit.  I''d probably give it a little more contrast in the midtones and I might play with the crop a little.  You could crop at the first window on the right and land the pump in a stronger visual position using the grass as leadlines from the corner..   Beautiful composition.  This is my kind of picture.', '2005-07-02 03:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499063, 195970, 6804, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  The reflection of additional antiquities adds interest to the shot and keeps it within a time zone.  9</td>', 'Very nice!  The reflection of additional antiquities adds interest to the shot and keeps it within a time zone.  9', '2005-07-02 03:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499068, 196759, 35602, '<td valign="top">What I liked the best - the use of backlighting.    The biggest problem I see is the glare created on the camera itself.  I''m not sure if you used a flshlight or if the contrast between thel light and dark were too much, but your shooting camera couldn''t process the light.</td>', 'What I liked the best - the use of backlighting.    The biggest problem I see is the glare created on the camera itself.  I''m not sure if you used a flshlight or if the contrast between thel light and dark were too much, but your shooting camera couldn''t process the light.', '2005-07-02 03:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499069, 197035, 6804, '<td valign="top">I love this! Excellent capture.  I like the tilt and the color of the car.  The grass is just a little bright in the foreground for my taste.  You could try burning the shadows some (slight).  Other than that, this is one of my favorites of the challenge.  9</td>', 'I love this! Excellent capture.  I like the tilt and the color of the car.  The grass is just a little bright in the foreground for my taste.  You could try burning the shadows some (slight).  Other than that, this is one of my favorites of the challenge.  9', '2005-07-02 03:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499072, 197167, 6804, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!  Great background color and DOF.  Excellent in every way.  10</td>', 'Awesome shot!  Great background color and DOF.  Excellent in every way.  10', '2005-07-02 03:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499073, 195277, 35602, '<td valign="top">What I liked the best was the way you did make the image seem ice-coated.  If you did actually freeze it, kudos for being very creative.  The thing I liked the least was the confusion created.  Can''t discern much detail, especially through the left center.</td>', 'What I liked the best was the way you did make the image seem ice-coated.  If you did actually freeze it, kudos for being very creative.  The thing I liked the least was the confusion created.  Can''t discern much detail, especially through the left center.', '2005-07-02 03:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499077, 197142, 35602, '<td valign="top">Sharper focus would have helped the image.  I did like the use of shallow depth of field in the background.</td>', 'Sharper focus would have helped the image.  I did like the use of shallow depth of field in the background.', '2005-07-02 03:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499079, 197432, 6804, '<td valign="top">I''m in love!   I don''t know what it is about these old gas pumps, but I just like them.  The pipe on the left is so perfect and the brown/yellowish sky adds to the feeling of obsolescence.  10</td>', 'I''m in love!   I don''t know what it is about these old gas pumps, but I just like them.  The pipe on the left is so perfect and the brown/yellowish sky adds to the feeling of obsolescence.  10', '2005-07-02 03:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499081, 197506, 31443, '<td valign="top">Love the texture of the flag and the whole composition is really good...</td>', 'Love the texture of the flag and the whole composition is really good...', '2005-07-02 03:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499082, 197622, 35602, '<td valign="top">I loved the sky detail and the color of the image.  However, by facing the sun, it created flares which then lowered detail of your pier.  The use of a hood above your lens fixes these problems.</td>', 'I loved the sky detail and the color of the image.  However, by facing the sun, it created flares which then lowered detail of your pier.  The use of a hood above your lens fixes these problems.', '2005-07-02 03:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499084, 197529, 35602, '<td valign="top">Too much extraineous ground detail.  The image is clear, but very distracting within itself.  Nice detail on the rusted front of the car.</td>', 'Too much extraineous ground detail.  The image is clear, but very distracting within itself.  Nice detail on the rusted front of the car.', '2005-07-02 03:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499086, 196353, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is simply a stunning picture!  But for the life of me, I can not think of how this is obsolete.</td>', 'This is simply a stunning picture!  But for the life of me, I can not think of how this is obsolete.', '2005-07-02 03:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499087, 197505, 6804, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  10  This is my favorite of the challenge so far.</td>', 'Whoa!  10  This is my favorite of the challenge so far.', '2005-07-02 03:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499088, 196833, 35602, '<td valign="top">Not enough subject.  The blacktop was very well represented in this one, and the detail of it can''t be beat, but the shoe itself kind of disappears into it.  Brighter lighting around the shoe and sharper focus would have made it pop.</td>', 'Not enough subject.  The blacktop was very well represented in this one, and the detail of it can''t be beat, but the shoe itself kind of disappears into it.  Brighter lighting around the shoe and sharper focus would have made it pop.', '2005-07-02 03:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499092, 196781, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice use of cube shape.  Contrast is excellent but composition seems out of whack.  Perhaps if the back cube had been placed more centered to form a triangle the image would have been more flowing.</td>', 'Nice use of cube shape.  Contrast is excellent but composition seems out of whack.  Perhaps if the back cube had been placed more centered to form a triangle the image would have been more flowing.', '2005-07-02 03:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499096, 195020, 35602, '<td valign="top">Color in image is its strongest point and you used it to your advantage.  As a macro you did a very good job of clearing up any possible grain which often occurs in that format.  The depth of field seemed to shallow in the image, though.</td>', 'Color in image is its strongest point and you used it to your advantage.  As a macro you did a very good job of clearing up any possible grain which often occurs in that format.  The depth of field seemed to shallow in the image, though.', '2005-07-02 03:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499099, 197176, 35602, '<td valign="top">If the gaussion blur was used in this image, I don''t think it helped it much.  The image is not easily identifiable.  I did like the way the colors came out on this one.  It''s warm tones about the best part of the picture.</td>', 'If the gaussion blur was used in this image, I don''t think it helped it much.  The image is not easily identifiable.  I did like the way the colors came out on this one.  It''s warm tones about the best part of the picture.', '2005-07-02 03:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
