(1499107, 196149, 35602, '<td valign="top">Interesting macro still.  Liked the way you angled this shot.  It doesn''t cry out ot me obsolete, though.  You do seem to know your way around technique, so it is more than just a snapshot.</td>', 'Interesting macro still.  Liked the way you angled this shot.  It doesn''t cry out ot me obsolete, though.  You do seem to know your way around technique, so it is more than just a snapshot.', '2005-07-02 03:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
