(1499125, 195848, 35602, '<td valign="top">Your framing of the book and camera in the cube was wonderful.  It gave it a natural border without looking forced.  The color of the books your chose made for a nice composition.  The camera is secondary in this image.  You could have almost done without it.</td>', 'Your framing of the book and camera in the cube was wonderful.  It gave it a natural border without looking forced.  The color of the books your chose made for a nice composition.  The camera is secondary in this image.  You could have almost done without it.', '2005-07-02 03:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
