(1499191, 195941, 21669, '<td valign="top">I have looked really closely but I still can''t work out what I am supposed to see.  It is a very interesting photo but I honestly can''t find any relation to obsolete?</td>', 'I have looked really closely but I still can''t work out what I am supposed to see.  It is a very interesting photo but I honestly can''t find any relation to obsolete?', '2005-07-02 05:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499192, 197138, 37380, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, but perhaps a bit too bright for my liking - perhaps it''s because the background is brighter than the subject? I don''t know. I can''t quite put my finger on it. I also find the shadow-play a bit distracting, making it hard to see the lovely patterns in the iron.<br/> <br/>I do like the way you have composed the shot, concentrating on only part of the sewing machine. It makes the viewer think a bit to work out what it is.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, but perhaps a bit too bright for my liking - perhaps it''s because the background is brighter than the subject? I don''t know. I can''t quite put my finger on it. I also find the shadow-play a bit distracting, making it hard to see the lovely patterns in the iron. I do like the way you have composed the shot, concentrating on only part of the sewing machine. It makes the viewer think a bit to work out what it is.', '2005-07-02 05:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499194, 197187, 37380, '<td valign="top">A lovely soft-focus entry with a warm feel to it. There are two things I feel would make this shot better though. The colour of the surface the recorder is standing on doesn''t complement the colour of the recorder - it would have been nice if it was a similar brown colour. The other point is that the dark/black areas don''t seem dark enough to me. Making these areas darker would make the subject stand out just that little bit more.<br/> <br/>But these are only minor issues in what is otherwise an outstanding entry. Well done!</td>', 'A lovely soft-focus entry with a warm feel to it. There are two things I feel would make this shot better though. The colour of the surface the recorder is standing on doesn''t complement the colour of the recorder - it would have been nice if it was a similar brown colour. The other point is that the dark/black areas don''t seem dark enough to me. Making these areas darker would make the subject stand out just that little bit more. But these are only minor issues in what is otherwise an outstanding entry. Well done!', '2005-07-02 05:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499197, 196221, 37380, '<td valign="top">There seems to be some odd colouring in the sky/branches in the top of the image. This may have been brought about by increasing the saturation too much perhaps? In any case, most of it could be cropped out without significantly impacting on your overall composition.<br/> <br/>The colours in the fence and garden are great, the image is nice and sharp and your subject meets the challenge well.</td>', 'There seems to be some odd colouring in the sky/branches in the top of the image. This may have been brought about by increasing the saturation too much perhaps? In any case, most of it could be cropped out without significantly impacting on your overall composition. The colours in the fence and garden are great, the image is nice and sharp and your subject meets the challenge well.', '2005-07-02 06:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499199, 196116, 37380, '<td valign="top">A great entry with that ''yester-year'' feel to it. For some reason my eyes are constantly drawn to the man as the subject though. I''m not sure why that is - possibly because of the tonal range on that side of the photo. The photo has been flawlessy executed though - with both near and far objects nice and sharp.</td>', 'A great entry with that ''yester-year'' feel to it. For some reason my eyes are constantly drawn to the man as the subject though. I''m not sure why that is - possibly because of the tonal range on that side of the photo. The photo has been flawlessy executed though - with both near and far objects nice and sharp.', '2005-07-02 06:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499204, 197436, 37380, '<td valign="top">Ah, those were the days... A nice ''promotional'' shot for the old ZX. The circuit diagram in the background is a nice touch. I would have liked a slightly closer shot so the text on the keys were a bit clearer - but that''s only a minor detail. Well done.</td>', 'Ah, those were the days... A nice ''promotional'' shot for the old ZX. The circuit diagram in the background is a nice touch. I would have liked a slightly closer shot so the text on the keys were a bit clearer - but that''s only a minor detail. Well done.', '2005-07-02 06:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499212, 197506, 37380, '<td valign="top">Great composition and beautiful colours in this shot. It appears that the flag is the subject being focussed on though, rather than the sewing machine which may lead the viewer to the wrong interpretation (I''m presuming it''s the sewing machine that is obsolete, and not the flag!)</td>', 'Great composition and beautiful colours in this shot. It appears that the flag is the subject being focussed on though, rather than the sewing machine which may lead the viewer to the wrong interpretation (I''m presuming it''s the sewing machine that is obsolete, and not the flag!)', '2005-07-02 06:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499215, 197611, 30392, '<td valign="top">Nice crop!</td>', 'Nice crop!', '2005-07-02 06:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499217, 197560, 30392, '<td valign="top">Looks like it could be better with more contrast</td>', 'Looks like it could be better with more contrast', '2005-07-02 06:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499221, 197167, 37380, '<td valign="top">A great shot, definitely worthy of a top 10 spot. The depth of field in this shot has been managed extremely well, with only the bottle in focus. The only critical comment I can really make is on the seemingly ''loud'' border - but that''s probably more a case of my personal taste than anything.</td>', 'A great shot, definitely worthy of a top 10 spot. The depth of field in this shot has been managed extremely well, with only the bottle in focus. The only critical comment I can really make is on the seemingly ''loud'' border - but that''s probably more a case of my personal taste than anything.', '2005-07-02 06:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499228, 194859, 30392, '<td valign="top">nice angle and comp, but the sky''s too blown, I like the take on the challenge though!</td>', 'nice angle and comp, but the sky''s too blown, I like the take on the challenge though!', '2005-07-02 06:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1499231, 196489, 37380, '<td valign="top">A great shot, nice and sharp with lovely colours. It took me quite a while to work out what was obsolete in the photo though (or rather ''how'' it was obsolete) - but I got there in the end.</td>', 'A great shot, nice and sharp with lovely colours. It took me quite a while to work out what was obsolete in the photo though (or rather ''how'' it was obsolete) - but I got there in the end.', '2005-07-02 06:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
