(1499360, 195399, 36141, '<td valign="top">''Rust Resistant''?? LOL you should bring it back and demand a new one. <br/>You meet the challenge, but by the quality of the photo, I''ll rate it a 6</td>', '''Rust Resistant''?? LOL you should bring it back and demand a new one. You meet the challenge, but by the quality of the photo, I''ll rate it a 6', '2005-07-02 08:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
