(1499373, 196929, 36141, '<td valign="top">Another day? Mmmm... come to think of it, an interesting point of view regarding obsolete, but I''ll buy it. Rather abstract for the most voters I think. Like your photo too, so I''ll rate it an 8</td>', 'Another day? Mmmm... come to think of it, an interesting point of view regarding obsolete, but I''ll buy it. Rather abstract for the most voters I think. Like your photo too, so I''ll rate it an 8', '2005-07-02 08:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
