(1499376, 197599, 36141, '<td valign="top">Sure fits the challenge, but a pity the most important part is so dark overshadowed. I''ll rate it a 6.</td>', 'Sure fits the challenge, but a pity the most important part is so dark overshadowed. I''ll rate it a 6.', '2005-07-02 08:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
