(1499968, 197640, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this. Good composition. Nice colors. Great shadows. Very good focus and DOF. Nice background. And a subject that actually meets the challenge. Having lived and worked in most of these countries I can resonate with their obsolescence. Well done!</td>', 'I like this. Good composition. Nice colors. Great shadows. Very good focus and DOF. Nice background. And a subject that actually meets the challenge. Having lived and worked in most of these countries I can resonate with their obsolescence. Well done!', '2005-07-02 14:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
