(1499971, 195267, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this quite a bit. I think I would like it better with stronger focus and a bit more emphasis on reflections. The grain doesn''t bother me but it may bother some voters. Well done!</td>', 'I like this quite a bit. I think I would like it better with stronger focus and a bit more emphasis on reflections. The grain doesn''t bother me but it may bother some voters. Well done!', '2005-07-02 14:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
