(1500005, 196448, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely photo. Dramatic sky. Nice lighting. Wonderful composition. Nicely leveled. It is indeed evocative of an obsolete way of life. And it reinforces my desire to go exploring. My top pick for the challenge. Thanks, and well done.</td>', 'This is a lovely photo. Dramatic sky. Nice lighting. Wonderful composition. Nicely leveled. It is indeed evocative of an obsolete way of life. And it reinforces my desire to go exploring. My top pick for the challenge. Thanks, and well done.', '2005-07-02 15:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1500011, 195777, 18197, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image. Would have worked well in Macro V or Circles, too. I like the colors and contrast most of all. You almost lost me with the foreground DOF but it''s okay. The composition including the circles and the strong triangle element is very powerful. This is among my top picks. I hope it ribbons.</td>', 'Fantastic image. Would have worked well in Macro V or Circles, too. I like the colors and contrast most of all. You almost lost me with the foreground DOF but it''s okay. The composition including the circles and the strong triangle element is very powerful. This is among my top picks. I hope it ribbons.', '2005-07-02 15:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
