(1500018, 195001, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a very appealing image. Well executed and presented. It is one of a small number of images that actually meet the challenge. It''s among my top picks and I hope it ribbons.</td>', 'This is a very appealing image. Well executed and presented. It is one of a small number of images that actually meet the challenge. It''s among my top picks and I hope it ribbons.', '2005-07-02 15:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
