(1500021, 197080, 18197, '<td valign="top">There are quite a few things I don''t like individually with this image but somehow the overall impact overcomes them all. In the end it is among my top picks. Good luck in the voting.</td>', 'There are quite a few things I don''t like individually with this image but somehow the overall impact overcomes them all. In the end it is among my top picks. Good luck in the voting.', '2005-07-02 15:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1500027, 196096, 18197, '<td valign="top">I hate the overly long and excrutiatingly descriptive title. The photo doesn''t meet the challenge IMO. But it is such a good photo and it is so well executed and presented that I''ve been bumping it up since the challenge began. It is among my top pick. Thanks for submitting it.</td>', 'I hate the overly long and excrutiatingly descriptive title. The photo doesn''t meet the challenge IMO. But it is such a good photo and it is so well executed and presented that I''ve been bumping it up since the challenge began. It is among my top pick. Thanks for submitting it.', '2005-07-02 15:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1500029, 195941, 18197, '<td valign="top">Okay, I looked closer. Still don''t see the Challenge relevance. Nice image though.</td>', 'Okay, I looked closer. Still don''t see the Challenge relevance. Nice image though.', '2005-07-02 15:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1500042, 197552, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am having trouble liking this image. Firstly, it is an over used cliche in this challenge (not you fault) but more importantly there are flaws that detract from the image: The dark upper right hand corner, the hot spots on the left and the indeterminate focus on the background. The centered and mostly symetric composition doesn''t create any interest in the subject. Sorry to sound negative, but maybe the feedback will help for next time.</td>', 'I am having trouble liking this image. Firstly, it is an over used cliche in this challenge (not you fault) but more importantly there are flaws that detract from the image: The dark upper right hand corner, the hot spots on the left and the indeterminate focus on the background. The centered and mostly symetric composition doesn''t create any interest in the subject. Sorry to sound negative, but maybe the feedback will help for next time.', '2005-07-02 15:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1500043, 195802, 29904, '<td valign="top">Great subject, exposure, color, cropping, etc.!  Perfect catch of the flowers and title, which takes it over the top!  10</td>', 'Great subject, exposure, color, cropping, etc.!  Perfect catch of the flowers and title, which takes it over the top!  10', '2005-07-02 15:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
