(1500085, 195849, 18197, '<td valign="top">IMO it''s a weak subject that mostly misses the spirit of the challenge. Title doesn''t help much since the rivalry certainly isn''t obsolete. I think multi-point lighting might have helped and a concentration more on the broken phone and less on its replacement. Just my opinion. Feel free to disregard.</td>', 'IMO it''s a weak subject that mostly misses the spirit of the challenge. Title doesn''t help much since the rivalry certainly isn''t obsolete. I think multi-point lighting might have helped and a concentration more on the broken phone and less on its replacement. Just my opinion. Feel free to disregard.', '2005-07-02 16:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1500086, 197618, 18197, '<td valign="top">IMO misses the spirit of the challenge.</td>', 'IMO misses the spirit of the challenge.', '2005-07-02 16:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1500089, 197592, 18197, '<td valign="top">IMO misses the spirit of the challenge. You may believe organized religion is obsolete but quite a few billion people would disagree. Maybe organized religion is obsolete in your life, in which case i can follow your logic a bit better.</td>', 'IMO misses the spirit of the challenge. You may believe organized religion is obsolete but quite a few billion people would disagree. Maybe organized religion is obsolete in your life, in which case i can follow your logic a bit better.', '2005-07-02 16:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1500092, 195584, 18197, '<td valign="top">IMO misses the spirit of the challenge. You may believe the Bible is obsolete but a  billion or so people would disagree. Maybe it is obsolete in your life, in which case I can follow your logic a bit better.</td>', 'IMO misses the spirit of the challenge. You may believe the Bible is obsolete but a  billion or so people would disagree. Maybe it is obsolete in your life, in which case I can follow your logic a bit better.', '2005-07-02 16:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1500099, 197431, 18197, '<td valign="top">IMO this misses the spirit of the challenge. I am trying to figure out what you''re trying to tell me: That marriage is obsolete, or That the sacredness of marriage is, or That a specific marriage is ... hmm. As for the photo, I think greater DOF that would reveal the reflection off the inside of the ring toward the top of the photo might have given it more interest. As it is, the emphasis seems to be on the words, not the ring. If so, the secondary element obscures the primary. If the subject is intended to be the ring, I''d give it more emphasis with stronger focus. Just my opinion. Feel free to disregard.</td>', 'IMO this misses the spirit of the challenge. I am trying to figure out what you''re trying to tell me: That marriage is obsolete, or That the sacredness of marriage is, or That a specific marriage is ... hmm. As for the photo, I think greater DOF that would reveal the reflection off the inside of the ring toward the top of the photo might have given it more interest. As it is, the emphasis seems to be on the words, not the ring. If so, the secondary element obscures the primary. If the subject is intended to be the ring, I''d give it more emphasis with stronger focus. Just my opinion. Feel free to disregard.', '2005-07-02 16:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1500102, 197156, 5015, '<td valign="top">It looks like a brand new ironing board to me...</td>', 'It looks like a brand new ironing board to me...', '2005-07-02 16:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1500104, 194181, 18197, '<td valign="top">My monitor is calibrated, so I think it must be the photo that is too dark. If it were a bit brighter, I could see the pipe a little better and I think it might have an interesting shape which would strengthen the composition. Also the focus on the medal and ribbon is pretty soft. Multipoint lighting might improve the contrast of the texture and if brighter let you shoot with a stopped down lens for greater DOF.</td>', 'My monitor is calibrated, so I think it must be the photo that is too dark. If it were a bit brighter, I could see the pipe a little better and I think it might have an interesting shape which would strengthen the composition. Also the focus on the medal and ribbon is pretty soft. Multipoint lighting might improve the contrast of the texture and if brighter let you shoot with a stopped down lens for greater DOF.', '2005-07-02 16:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1500107, 195480, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good thing they disappear or there would be no children.<br/> <br/>IMO you missed the spirit of the challenge.</td>', 'Good thing they disappear or there would be no children. IMO you missed the spirit of the challenge.', '2005-07-02 16:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
