(1500132, 197426, 24314, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but I can''t see what this has to do with being obsolete, unless it''s that your kids don''t use it anymore? still a nice picture</td>', 'I''m sorry but I can''t see what this has to do with being obsolete, unless it''s that your kids don''t use it anymore? still a nice picture', '2005-07-02 16:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
