(1500372, 196782, 22517, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours, nice composition and subject. The spots are distracting, though. This picture is very alike the one with the leaf on the car hood (at least I think it''s a car hood ;-)</td>', 'Beautiful colours, nice composition and subject. The spots are distracting, though. This picture is very alike the one with the leaf on the car hood (at least I think it''s a car hood ;-)', '2005-07-02 18:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
