(1500387, 195950, 7743, '<td valign="top">Shallow DOF I think is appropriate here however I feel that it is a little too shallow.  Slightly more would give more definition to the glove in the background therefore improving the context of the image.</td>', 'Shallow DOF I think is appropriate here however I feel that it is a little too shallow.  Slightly more would give more definition to the glove in the background therefore improving the context of the image.', '2005-07-02 18:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
