(1500516, 197035, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this. With all of the old delapidated vehicles, this is well done with the crooked angle of the car.  I think it is overexposed though. Maybe it would be better to shoot it early or late in  the day??</td>', 'I like this. With all of the old delapidated vehicles, this is well done with the crooked angle of the car.  I think it is overexposed though. Maybe it would be better to shoot it early or late in  the day??', '2005-07-02 20:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
