(1500526, 197419, 15711, '<td valign="top">Um.... just a bit too staged for my taste. I''d like it better if maybe a tighter DOF with some of the items piled on each other a bit more, instead of so spread out.  The contrast in color is nice.  The idea is good.  Not quite focused enough for my eye.</td>', 'Um.... just a bit too staged for my taste. I''d like it better if maybe a tighter DOF with some of the items piled on each other a bit more, instead of so spread out.  The contrast in color is nice.  The idea is good.  Not quite focused enough for my eye.', '2005-07-02 20:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1500527, 197562, 30791, '<td valign="top">for once i actually like the grain in a picture, 7</td>', 'for once i actually like the grain in a picture, 7', '2005-07-02 20:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1500528, 196270, 15711, '<td valign="top">The tight crop and rolled film adds interest here. The colors a nice and vivid, but overall, it just doesn''t have the "POW" that I''m looking for.</td>', 'The tight crop and rolled film adds interest here. The colors a nice and vivid, but overall, it just doesn''t have the "POW" that I''m looking for.', '2005-07-02 20:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
