(1500807, 196116, 31319, '<td valign="top">The clutter in the trailor behind the gent is distracting but somewhat forgivable given the clarity of the steam engine itself and  the composition.  Black and white was the way to go on this capture.  Well done.  Rate: 9</td>', 'The clutter in the trailor behind the gent is distracting but somewhat forgivable given the clarity of the steam engine itself and  the composition.  Black and white was the way to go on this capture.  Well done.  Rate: 9', '2005-07-03 00:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
