(1500829, 196782, 36309, '<td valign="top">A very nice shot - I like the contrast and the way that the water is so dark it almost looks like oil - the ripples are great.  It''s a shame about the white spots floating on the water, but obviously not much you can do about those with basic editing.</td>', 'A very nice shot - I like the contrast and the way that the water is so dark it almost looks like oil - the ripples are great.  It''s a shame about the white spots floating on the water, but obviously not much you can do about those with basic editing.', '2005-07-03 00:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
