(1501008, 196218, 4767, '<td valign="top">cool photo - wish it were larger.</td>', 'cool photo - wish it were larger.', '2005-07-03 01:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1501044, 197592, 4767, '<td valign="top">Funny how when people on this site say Organized Religion is obsolete, they seem to depict Christian religion.  Why not a Buddha or a mosque?  I am not a believer in crucifixes nor do I revere depictions of a dead God, but I am offended by this photo.  It''s a well designed photo,  3 crosses for emphasis, and a properly exposed, well placed foreground image.  Technically, not a sub-5 score.  But if you have paid any attention whatsoever to what types of shots are submitted, you know there are a great number of devoted believers on DPC who WILL be offended by this. <br/> <br/>Yes, you have a right to express your opinion, but as a member of a community, you might have some concern for your fellow contributors.  And they have the right to be offended and to rate you accordingly.  Just my opinion.  I have no dog in this hunt, but I have a lot of peers whose feelings I have concerns for.</td>', 'Funny how when people on this site say Organized Religion is obsolete, they seem to depict Christian religion.  Why not a Buddha or a mosque?  I am not a believer in crucifixes nor do I revere depictions of a dead God, but I am offended by this photo.  It''s a well designed photo,  3 crosses for emphasis, and a properly exposed, well placed foreground image.  Technically, not a sub-5 score.  But if you have paid any attention whatsoever to what types of shots are submitted, you know there are a great number of devoted believers on DPC who WILL be offended by this.  Yes, you have a right to express your opinion, but as a member of a community, you might have some concern for your fellow contributors.  And they have the right to be offended and to rate you accordingly.  Just my opinion.  I have no dog in this hunt, but I have a lot of peers whose feelings I have concerns for.', '2005-07-03 01:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
