(1501640, 197602, 38476, '<td valign="top">Top points for putting together a photo that gets an emotional response! But many people won''t view this merely as a sexual photo, but as a crude sexual photo (&amp; photos that are just sexual get enough grief!)<br/> <br/>You''re a skilled photographer &amp; lots of things about the shot are well done - lighting, colors, background, shadow, frozen motion, etc., but this is like displaying a photograph of a popular, well-loved celebrity being killed (&amp; the body being mutilated), then shaking one''s head sadly because the celebrity''s fans couldn''t remove their emotions from the situation &amp; admire the technical expertise of the photograph.</td>', 'Top points for putting together a photo that gets an emotional response! But many people won''t view this merely as a sexual photo, but as a crude sexual photo (& photos that are just sexual get enough grief!) You''re a skilled photographer & lots of things about the shot are well done - lighting, colors, background, shadow, frozen motion, etc., but this is like displaying a photograph of a popular, well-loved celebrity being killed (& the body being mutilated), then shaking one''s head sadly because the celebrity''s fans couldn''t remove their emotions from the situation & admire the technical expertise of the photograph.', '2005-07-03 12:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
