(1502321, 197518, 40164, '<td valign="top">Wow -- that''s a very nice contrast between the lighthouse and that huge bridge and power lines. This shot grabbed my attention immediately! Unfortunately, all those towery things also make the picture a bit busy -- my eyes just keep going over the thing in search of a place to, you know, rest. =]</td>', 'Wow -- that''s a very nice contrast between the lighthouse and that huge bridge and power lines. This shot grabbed my attention immediately! Unfortunately, all those towery things also make the picture a bit busy -- my eyes just keep going over the thing in search of a place to, you know, rest. =]', '2005-07-03 20:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
