(1502352, 195584, 20856, '<td valign="top">How INCREDIBLE.<br/>Take a bible, snap a picture of it, then title it "religion".   Cause it''s the ''obsolete'' challenge,so creative. I mean why even make it a good or interesting or well framed picture, that would take away from the oh so important message.  Heck let''s stop taking photos altogether and just start writing letters to each other about our stances on different topics!<br/> <br/>    Quit making statements and make a real photograph.</td>', 'How INCREDIBLE.Take a bible, snap a picture of it, then title it "religion".   Cause it''s the ''obsolete'' challenge,so creative. I mean why even make it a good or interesting or well framed picture, that would take away from the oh so important message.  Heck let''s stop taking photos altogether and just start writing letters to each other about our stances on different topics!     Quit making statements and make a real photograph.', '2005-07-03 20:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1502354, 194262, 33379, '<td valign="top">very classy in my top two!</td>', 'very classy in my top two!', '2005-07-03 20:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
