(1502555, 197380, 33400, '<td valign="top">beautiful layout, foreground and background. In my humble opinion, you have taken the theme and put art to it.</td>', 'beautiful layout, foreground and background. In my humble opinion, you have taken the theme and put art to it.', '2005-07-03 23:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1502559, 197275, 33400, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot.  I wish you could have found a way to keep the beach but bring the castle closer.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot.  I wish you could have found a way to keep the beach but bring the castle closer.', '2005-07-03 23:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1502571, 197531, 34547, '<td valign="top">I like the work that you put into getting all the parts in this. I''m not so thrilled about the photograph on its own. But, I think you''ve met challenge appropriately, put some effort and creativity into it, and I''ve been rather disappointed with the rest of the entries (I rate on a curve).</td>', 'I like the work that you put into getting all the parts in this. I''m not so thrilled about the photograph on its own. But, I think you''ve met challenge appropriately, put some effort and creativity into it, and I''ve been rather disappointed with the rest of the entries (I rate on a curve).', '2005-07-03 23:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1502579, 195708, 33947, '<td valign="top">Interesting looking bug, and the lighting is nice, but, I don''t see anything obsolete about this photo.</td>', 'Interesting looking bug, and the lighting is nice, but, I don''t see anything obsolete about this photo.', '2005-07-03 23:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1502581, 197432, 34547, '<td valign="top">Well done. Waiting for the sun to be the right color did this image good. I''m sure you debaited cropping the pole out, I''m debaiting it, too. It might be keeping this image in balance. 8</td>', 'Well done. Waiting for the sun to be the right color did this image good. I''m sure you debaited cropping the pole out, I''m debaiting it, too. It might be keeping this image in balance. 8', '2005-07-03 23:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1502587, 195708, 38476, '<td valign="top">Obsolete? How?</td>', 'Obsolete? How?', '2005-07-03 23:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
