(1506442, 197055, 40259, '<td valign="top">A haunting image.  Great use of B&amp;W.  This image has a lot of energy.  But the hollow eye is a little off-putting.</td>', 'A haunting image.  Great use of B&W.  This image has a lot of energy.  But the hollow eye is a little off-putting.', '2005-07-04 22:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506450, 196267, 40259, '<td valign="top">This feels like an original image.  Takes the old wooden wagon wheel one step further.  But I think the composition could have been better.  The subject is too centered - the composition has no flow.  Also, like the B&amp;W but maybe too dark?</td>', 'This feels like an original image.  Takes the old wooden wagon wheel one step further.  But I think the composition could have been better.  The subject is too centered - the composition has no flow.  Also, like the B&W but maybe too dark?', '2005-07-04 22:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506543, 197593, 30822, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect, sorry your cat is blind. I had a 20 yr. old cat simalar to this one. I scored you low because of the harsh light, (I''m guessing direct flash), really blows out the fur on the bridge of the nose and the subject doesn''t pop for me.</td>', 'Interesting effect, sorry your cat is blind. I had a 20 yr. old cat simalar to this one. I scored you low because of the harsh light, (I''m guessing direct flash), really blows out the fur on the bridge of the nose and the subject doesn''t pop for me.', '2005-07-04 23:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506547, 195677, 30822, '<td valign="top">I voted this a 4 for the following reasons. 1. Picture is very small, so very little detail can be seen. 2. It''s kind of a snap shot, the framing is direct on. (Possibly a lower angle and a little closer would have made it pop more for me) 3. It doesn''t have lot of contrast. IMHO</td>', 'I voted this a 4 for the following reasons. 1. Picture is very small, so very little detail can be seen. 2. It''s kind of a snap shot, the framing is direct on. (Possibly a lower angle and a little closer would have made it pop more for me) 3. It doesn''t have lot of contrast. IMHO', '2005-07-04 23:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506551, 196616, 30822, '<td valign="top">Voted this a 3 on my first pass, moving it up to 5 on this one. In future challenges you may want to consider a larger picture (640 pixels is allowed). Voters here, including myself, tend to score low for smaller pics. That said, overall not a bad pic technically, just dosen''t pop for me compositionally.</td>', 'Voted this a 3 on my first pass, moving it up to 5 on this one. In future challenges you may want to consider a larger picture (640 pixels is allowed). Voters here, including myself, tend to score low for smaller pics. That said, overall not a bad pic technically, just dosen''t pop for me compositionally.', '2005-07-04 23:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506558, 196816, 30822, '<td valign="top">Voted this 3 on the firstgo, moving it up to a 5 this one. The size really bothers me, you can post up to 640 pixels and you lose a lot of detail when you post his small. Technically it''s an ok picture, maybe a little blown out on the right upper side. Compositionally I would have moved in closer and left out some of the plants. Of course this just my opinon.</td>', 'Voted this 3 on the firstgo, moving it up to a 5 this one. The size really bothers me, you can post up to 640 pixels and you lose a lot of detail when you post his small. Technically it''s an ok picture, maybe a little blown out on the right upper side. Compositionally I would have moved in closer and left out some of the plants. Of course this just my opinon.', '2005-07-04 23:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506561, 197309, 30822, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote this one very high because of the depth of field. The foreground being that out of focus and the background being so sharp yet being blocked by the front just doesn''t work for me, IMHO. Good title though.</td>', 'I didn''t vote this one very high because of the depth of field. The foreground being that out of focus and the background being so sharp yet being blocked by the front just doesn''t work for me, IMHO. Good title though.', '2005-07-04 23:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506566, 197641, 30822, '<td valign="top">Needs a little more contrast, highlights are a tad bit blown on the rim. Compositionally this pic didn''t WOW me. 5.</td>', 'Needs a little more contrast, highlights are a tad bit blown on the rim. Compositionally this pic didn''t WOW me. 5.', '2005-07-04 23:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506573, 197602, 30822, '<td valign="top">Gave you 4 for the following reasons. 1. White Balance is off, there is hardly any true white in this pic. 2. It''s composition didn''t do anything for me. I appreciate the joke and am glad you diidn''t use brown syrup like the last leaky condom pic I saw.</td>', 'Gave you 4 for the following reasons. 1. White Balance is off, there is hardly any true white in this pic. 2. It''s composition didn''t do anything for me. I appreciate the joke and am glad you diidn''t use brown syrup like the last leaky condom pic I saw.', '2005-07-04 23:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
