(1509004, 197016, 37875, '<td valign="top">If this were the price actually listed on the pump, I would have enjoyed the photo focusing in on that fact.  Perhaps a closer shot of the pump''s display?    The plant seems to steal some of the focus away from the pump as well.  I like the washed out effect...it feels as though the pump were out in the desert for years.</td>', 'If this were the price actually listed on the pump, I would have enjoyed the photo focusing in on that fact.  Perhaps a closer shot of the pump''s display?    The plant seems to steal some of the focus away from the pump as well.  I like the washed out effect...it feels as though the pump were out in the desert for years.', '2005-07-05 21:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1509005, 197020, 37875, '<td valign="top">The contrast between red and grey is appealing, but I''ve got a working one of these in my neighborhood so it doesn''t strike me as being obsolete, even in a world of cell phones...</td>', 'The contrast between red and grey is appealing, but I''ve got a working one of these in my neighborhood so it doesn''t strike me as being obsolete, even in a world of cell phones...', '2005-07-05 21:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
