(1509007, 196320, 37875, '<td valign="top">nice layout, but I wish the book''s face would have come through a bit clearer.  I have to strain to read "holy bible" and I would have liked to see it just pop out.</td>', 'nice layout, but I wish the book''s face would have come through a bit clearer.  I have to strain to read "holy bible" and I would have liked to see it just pop out.', '2005-07-05 21:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1509008, 197561, 37875, '<td valign="top">Nice view, but I feel like it lacks pizzazz (sp?).  Perhaps colored vinyl is needed, or some sort of lighting?  Wish I were more techie.  I think it''s the all-black that lessens the impact of this photo for me.  Like the subject!</td>', 'Nice view, but I feel like it lacks pizzazz (sp?).  Perhaps colored vinyl is needed, or some sort of lighting?  Wish I were more techie.  I think it''s the all-black that lessens the impact of this photo for me.  Like the subject!', '2005-07-05 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
