(1509885, 197380, 30861, '<td valign="top">I had this figured for top 10. I wonder if the white building pulled it down? I didn''t really notice that before. Regardless, great finish and a fine shot.</td>', 'I had this figured for top 10. I wonder if the white building pulled it down? I didn''t really notice that before. Regardless, great finish and a fine shot.', '2005-07-06 01:34:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1509910, 196994, 39928, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the kind and helpful comments! I was very lucky to find that car while on my drive around the east coast. I didnt plan on entering the challenge, but it called out to me, I''m obsolete! :-) <br/> <br/>I took a few shots where I moved the foreground weeds out of the way, but then noticed that I liked the photos with the weeds much better, added to the obsolete feel of it, as if it has been engulfed by nature.... <br/> <br/>Again thanks to all for your votes and comments!  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Thank you all for the kind and helpful comments! I was very lucky to find that car while on my drive around the east coast. I didnt plan on entering the challenge, but it called out to me, I''m obsolete! :-)  I took a few shots where I moved the foreground weeds out of the way, but then noticed that I liked the photos with the weeds much better, added to the obsolete feel of it, as if it has been engulfed by nature....  Again thanks to all for your votes and comments!   ', '2005-07-06 01:36:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1509927, 194213, 7570, '<td valign="top">this is absurd! how could this photo rated so low? Its technically good and with a honest sense of reality in it! damn trolls!</td>', 'this is absurd! how could this photo rated so low? Its technically good and with a honest sense of reality in it! damn trolls!', '2005-07-06 01:38:36.000000', NULL, 0),
