(1510074, 197005, 28742, '<td valign="top">Missed voting on this entry, but would''ve been a 7. Cropped a little tight, IMO, but overall very good. Has a certain gritty feel to it.</td>', 'Missed voting on this entry, but would''ve been a 7. Cropped a little tight, IMO, but overall very good. Has a certain gritty feel to it.', '2005-07-06 02:01:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1510075, 197435, 31990, '<td valign="top">Even the challenge is done just wanted to let you know that there is NO sepia in this picture and NO color effects.<br/>This is how the picture came out from the camera.<br/>Except the crop I didn''t do anything.<br/>The color came from the highway lights.<br/>And I thought it''s cool since it amplifies the feeling of rust and misery.<br/>If I was trying to change something I was about to be DQ.<br/>I must confess it is rather something forgotten than obsolete.<br/>Hope I will do better in the future.<br/> <br/>A BIG THANK YOU for all the helpful comments.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-06 01:03:36.</i></td>', 'Even the challenge is done just wanted to let you know that there is NO sepia in this picture and NO color effects.This is how the picture came out from the camera.Except the crop I didn''t do anything.The color came from the highway lights.And I thought it''s cool since it amplifies the feeling of rust and misery.If I was trying to change something I was about to be DQ.I must confess it is rather something forgotten than obsolete.Hope I will do better in the future. A BIG THANK YOU for all the helpful comments.', '2005-07-06 02:01:55.000000', '2005-07-06 02:03:36.000000', 0),
(1510079, 197506, 28742, '<td valign="top">Super finish! Very nice shot also. Timely subject matter helped a bit also! :) Congrats.</td>', 'Super finish! Very nice shot also. Timely subject matter helped a bit also! :) Congrats.', '2005-07-06 02:03:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1510091, 195001, 30857, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your top five for this wonderful picture ... so close to the ribbon too bad you didn''t grab one :)). Enhorabuena!!!!! :)))</td>', 'Congratulations on your top five for this wonderful picture ... so close to the ribbon too bad you didn''t grab one :)). Enhorabuena!!!!! :)))', '2005-07-06 02:05:18.000000', NULL, 0),
