(1510166, 197506, 3669, '<td valign="top">I really liked this picture and its symbolism.  Congrats on your top 20 finish, however, I must admit that I''m a bit disappointed that it didn''t finish higher.  :-)</td>', 'I really liked this picture and its symbolism.  Congrats on your top 20 finish, however, I must admit that I''m a bit disappointed that it didn''t finish higher.  :-)', '2005-07-06 02:32:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(1510178, 197053, 3669, '<td valign="top">OMG!  I do feel VERY dense (see my comment below).  I didn''t catch onto the woody people thing.  Now that I see the symbolism of it, I understand the picture WAY better.  Please forgive me.  I bow down in honor of this great picture and its maker.  Congrats on your top 20.</td>', 'OMG!  I do feel VERY dense (see my comment below).  I didn''t catch onto the woody people thing.  Now that I see the symbolism of it, I understand the picture WAY better.  Please forgive me.  I bow down in honor of this great picture and its maker.  Congrats on your top 20.', '2005-07-06 02:38:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1510236, 197210, 37893, '<td valign="top">I voted an 8 for this photo. DOF is good. I liked the poetry behind the image. I would have probably had the background a foot behind the shoes so that you couldn''t see it. Great job.</td>', 'I voted an 8 for this photo. DOF is good. I liked the poetry behind the image. I would have probably had the background a foot behind the shoes so that you couldn''t see it. Great job.', '2005-07-06 02:55:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1510245, 196320, 36377, '<td valign="top">To clarify to everyone about so much religion in the world. I believe the callenge stated somthing that has "outlived it''s usefulness". The definition to me had nothing to do with how often the item is still used. I expected to get slammed for my beliefs though so no hard feelings. All in the eye of the beholder.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-06 02:01:45.</i></td>', 'To clarify to everyone about so much religion in the world. I believe the callenge stated somthing that has "outlived it''s usefulness". The definition to me had nothing to do with how often the item is still used. I expected to get slammed for my beliefs though so no hard feelings. All in the eye of the beholder.', '2005-07-06 02:59:01.000000', '2005-07-06 03:01:45.000000', 0),
