(1510381, 196116, 5354, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone. I had to wait several minutes for the guy to stop watching what I was doing. I didn''t want him looking straight into the lens. The crop was a little forced in that there is a load of 20th century crap just out of frame which really cluttered up any other crop.<br/>The difference in contrast is due to the smoke from another traction engine just up wind.<br/> <br/>Once again thanks for the comments, much appreciated.</td>', 'Thanks everyone. I had to wait several minutes for the guy to stop watching what I was doing. I didn''t want him looking straight into the lens. The crop was a little forced in that there is a load of 20th century crap just out of frame which really cluttered up any other crop.The difference in contrast is due to the smoke from another traction engine just up wind. Once again thanks for the comments, much appreciated.', '2005-07-06 03:33:56.000000', NULL, 0),
