(1510436, 197053, 18450, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top 20 placing. This is such a creative, emotive image.....makes you feel really bad for the Woodies!! What will happen to them.......where will they go! The plastic fantastics don''t look to have half the personality, the flair, the pizazz of the Woodies!! <br/> <br/>Great shot adding to my favs!</td>', 'Congrats on your top 20 placing. This is such a creative, emotive image.....makes you feel really bad for the Woodies!! What will happen to them.......where will they go! The plastic fantastics don''t look to have half the personality, the flair, the pizazz of the Woodies!!  Great shot adding to my favs!', '2005-07-06 03:50:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1510477, 195504, 36616, '<td valign="top">You were kind enough to leave me a very useful comment. I''m sorry I missed your pic during voting but I think you made a good capture. The grain and the b&amp;w improve this pic giving it the old time feel. If only you could have taken one with no other cars in the frame! Improving contrast may have given it more impact but equally could have taken away from the old feel. Good luck, keep on commenting and youi''ll break that 5 barrier soon.</td>', 'You were kind enough to leave me a very useful comment. I''m sorry I missed your pic during voting but I think you made a good capture. The grain and the b&w improve this pic giving it the old time feel. If only you could have taken one with no other cars in the frame! Improving contrast may have given it more impact but equally could have taken away from the old feel. Good luck, keep on commenting and youi''ll break that 5 barrier soon.', '2005-07-06 04:05:01.000000', NULL, 0),
