(1510690, 196179, 27605, '<td valign="top">Way to go, Carol!  You win by far, 76th percentile and a FAV.  It''s a neat looking place.  Good job, my friend :o)</td>', 'Way to go, Carol!  You win by far, 76th percentile and a FAV.  It''s a neat looking place.  Good job, my friend :o)', '2005-07-06 05:47:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1510727, 197013, 18552, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorites in the challenge - it is so well done. So many of the pictures in this challenge actually were pictures of things that were old and broken not obsolete - yours truly represents obsolete items in a very interesting and artistic way. I was one of the 10''s on your picture.</td>', 'This was one of my favorites in the challenge - it is so well done. So many of the pictures in this challenge actually were pictures of things that were old and broken not obsolete - yours truly represents obsolete items in a very interesting and artistic way. I was one of the 10''s on your picture.', '2005-07-06 06:15:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1510729, 196179, 24314, '<td valign="top">thanks to all who commented on this picture. I know a few said it didn''t meet the challenge, but it was a nice day,a nice pic and I had fun. It was obsolete,as it wasn''t being used anymore and nature had taken over, can''t really say more than that about it. (",)</td>', 'thanks to all who commented on this picture. I know a few said it didn''t meet the challenge, but it was a nice day,a nice pic and I had fun. It was obsolete,as it wasn''t being used anymore and nature had taken over, can''t really say more than that about it. (",)', '2005-07-06 06:20:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1510732, 197555, 24314, '<td valign="top">He or she is beautiful, I love any equine animal! I can see where you''re coming from for the challenge, I think the most common jobs for these poor animals is having kids on the backs of them going up and down a beach in the hot sun.....a far cry from the useful jobs they were used to. Well done though, a lovely pic.</td>', 'He or she is beautiful, I love any equine animal! I can see where you''re coming from for the challenge, I think the most common jobs for these poor animals is having kids on the backs of them going up and down a beach in the hot sun.....a far cry from the useful jobs they were used to. Well done though, a lovely pic.', '2005-07-06 06:25:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1510735, 196637, 5599, '<td valign="top">Thanks guys!<br/> <br/>Wow, I actually got a couple of tens! I really appreciate all the comments too.</td>', 'Thanks guys! Wow, I actually got a couple of tens! I really appreciate all the comments too.', '2005-07-06 06:26:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1510737, 197505, 7810, '<td valign="top">nice to see you in the top 10 nice pic !!</td>', 'nice to see you in the top 10 nice pic !!', '2005-07-06 06:28:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1510763, 197313, 38889, '<td valign="top">Til hamingju Árni.. jamm.. maður er forvitinn á að vita hvar þetta er. Ég verð nú að segja það að á meðan keppninni stóð datt mér í hug að þetta væri á Íslandi. :D</td>', 'Til hamingju Árni.. jamm.. maður er forvitinn á að vita hvar þetta er. Ég verð nú að segja það að á meðan keppninni stóð datt mér í hug að þetta væri á Íslandi. :D', '2005-07-06 06:48:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1510803, 196448, 35517, '<td valign="top">CONGRATS.... i love this shot... i had to look twice to see if it was not a paiinting.... well done...</td>', 'CONGRATS.... i love this shot... i had to look twice to see if it was not a paiinting.... well done...', '2005-07-06 07:05:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1510814, 197080, 33520, '<td valign="top">Congrats!!! Stunning pic!!! :)</td>', 'Congrats!!! Stunning pic!!! :)', '2005-07-06 07:09:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1510828, 197178, 34255, '<td valign="top">excellent lighting. might perhaps be better if it was not so tightly cropped, and if it were not exactly in the center.  But it really deserved a much better rating. &lt;3</td>', 'excellent lighting. might perhaps be better if it was not so tightly cropped, and if it were not exactly in the center.  But it really deserved a much better rating. <3', '2005-07-06 07:12:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1510845, 195001, 19333, '<td valign="top">WOW, I''m sooooo happy with this honorable mention, I still cannot believe my eyes :D  I <b>never</b> thought it will ribbon and got so close ;)!!   I''ll try to do it that little bit better next time so I got it.<br/> <br/>Thank y''all for your votes and specially for your comments, I truly appreciate your time.<br/> <br/>The history behind... Found the razor at my sister''s home by chance. The hard part then was getting the blade, as the razor alone couldn''t have seen as meeting the challenge. Being something so old I guess many of us will not know what it actually was... Me myself had to think twice what it was when I first saw it. I''ll return the razor together with a framed print to my sister and share with her this amazing time.<br/> <br/>Staged it on my desk with a black cardboard, a desk halogen lamp diffused with a plastic mat and spotted the blade with a "hand-screened" torch so  only the blade was lightened.<br/> <br/>Carlos.<br/> <br/>PS: Gracias, Arancha!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-06 17:06:15.</i></td>', 'WOW, I''m sooooo happy with this honorable mention, I still cannot believe my eyes :D  I never thought it will ribbon and got so close ;)!!   I''ll try to do it that little bit better next time so I got it. Thank y''all for your votes and specially for your comments, I truly appreciate your time. The history behind... Found the razor at my sister''s home by chance. The hard part then was getting the blade, as the razor alone couldn''t have seen as meeting the challenge. Being something so old I guess many of us will not know what it actually was... Me myself had to think twice what it was when I first saw it. I''ll return the razor together with a framed print to my sister and share with her this amazing time. Staged it on my desk with a black cardboard, a desk halogen lamp diffused with a plastic mat and spotted the blade with a "hand-screened" torch so  only the blade was lightened. Carlos. PS: Gracias, Arancha!', '2005-07-06 07:30:15.000000', '2005-07-06 18:06:15.000000', 0),
(1510869, 197313, 34508, '<td valign="top">Hi arnit,<br/> <br/>I don''t intend to insult your work in any way. However, I am used to much better ideas/style/setup/composition/quality in your pictures and therefore cannot quite understand why this scored so high.<br/> <br/>In my opinion this shot lacks of originality that I liked so much in past entries. Sorry! :-)<br/> <br/>Lucas<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi arnit, I don''t intend to insult your work in any way. However, I am used to much better ideas/style/setup/composition/quality in your pictures and therefore cannot quite understand why this scored so high. In my opinion this shot lacks of originality that I liked so much in past entries. Sorry! :-) Lucas ', '2005-07-06 07:44:10.000000', NULL, 0),
