(1520409, 197055, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is really cool Kate...I didn''t vote or even really look at many of the "obsolete" entries...I came across one entry that turned my stomach a bit and ran the other way...anyway...love the B &amp; W and the grain...grain is good, grain is tasty. I keep asking myself...how would have some of these people coped with film, you know what I mean?...the face too, and that nasty crack...all together they conjure up a somewhat sinister mood...I like a bit of sinister, maybe because I''m left handed perhaps? It''s the eye...that eye is what puts this image over the edge...</td>', 'This is really cool Kate...I didn''t vote or even really look at many of the "obsolete" entries...I came across one entry that turned my stomach a bit and ran the other way...anyway...love the B & W and the grain...grain is good, grain is tasty. I keep asking myself...how would have some of these people coped with film, you know what I mean?...the face too, and that nasty crack...all together they conjure up a somewhat sinister mood...I like a bit of sinister, maybe because I''m left handed perhaps? It''s the eye...that eye is what puts this image over the edge...', '2005-07-09 01:07:19.000000', NULL, 0),
