(1527481, 195020, 39221, '<td valign="top">So many people missed the point here - eventually the net will make everything snail mail obsolete, I''m sure there are millions of people that no longer write letters to post, and instead use email.<br/> <br/>A great photo, and a great idea - unfortunately wasted one some I guess.<br/> <br/>The DOF works fine for me, focused on the price (which is also part of the obsolete theme - mail on the net is basically free to send).<br/> <br/>I like your style Sticky :-)<br/> <br/>Snail mail is obsolete and only used by those unwilling to move with the times, or slow to move with the times.<br/> <br/>The last time I posted something? hmmm about 10 minutes ago, I hit SEND!  ;-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-11 15:39:28.</i></td>', 'So many people missed the point here - eventually the net will make everything snail mail obsolete, I''m sure there are millions of people that no longer write letters to post, and instead use email. A great photo, and a great idea - unfortunately wasted one some I guess. The DOF works fine for me, focused on the price (which is also part of the obsolete theme - mail on the net is basically free to send). I like your style Sticky :-) Snail mail is obsolete and only used by those unwilling to move with the times, or slow to move with the times. The last time I posted something? hmmm about 10 minutes ago, I hit SEND!  ;-)', '2005-07-11 16:37:35.000000', '2005-07-11 16:39:28.000000', 0),
