(1545143, 197053, 13026, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GinaRothfels:</b></div><hr/><i> What, no ribbon?  I don''t think I''ve ever seen so much emotion captured using Woodies. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Ditto!  lol  This is great...So creative!  :)</td>', 'Originally posted by GinaRothfels: What, no ribbon?  I don''t think I''ve ever seen so much emotion captured using Woodies.  Ditto!  lol  This is great...So creative!  :)', '2005-07-18 23:35:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1551498, 195676, 14671, '<td valign="top">In my opinon the subject lacks interest and the title should have read "Size DOES Matter".  This way it would have made more of a statement.  As for the photo the screen of the LCD looks either dirty or the overhead lights are playing havoc on the screen itself and projecting a glare.  I also would have positioned the screen a little to the left to get rid of the distracting background (shelf perhaps?).  However it did fit the challenge very well and has a very nice choice in DOF.</td>', 'In my opinon the subject lacks interest and the title should have read "Size DOES Matter".  This way it would have made more of a statement.  As for the photo the screen of the LCD looks either dirty or the overhead lights are playing havoc on the screen itself and projecting a glare.  I also would have positioned the screen a little to the left to get rid of the distracting background (shelf perhaps?).  However it did fit the challenge very well and has a very nice choice in DOF.', '2005-07-20 21:33:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1555699, 195086, 24613, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice, peaceful photo.  I really like the country feel to it.  Maybe someday you could revisit this place and get a shot with a beep blue sky and some clouds.  I think this shot should have scored higher. :)</td>', 'This is a very nice, peaceful photo.  I really like the country feel to it.  Maybe someday you could revisit this place and get a shot with a beep blue sky and some clouds.  I think this shot should have scored higher. :)', '2005-07-22 18:46:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1558356, 197525, 11800, '<td valign="top">Just saw this one. Up here in Minnesota, family albums are going stronger than ever. Creative Memories, the first big scrapbooking company was started in a garage not far from my house. Women have parties to sort photos and discuss the layout for their next album. So, at least for this area, they run no risk of becoming obsolete.<br/>Nice picture. Must be a joy to handle that camera.</td>', 'Just saw this one. Up here in Minnesota, family albums are going stronger than ever. Creative Memories, the first big scrapbooking company was started in a garage not far from my house. Women have parties to sort photos and discuss the layout for their next album. So, at least for this area, they run no risk of becoming obsolete.Nice picture. Must be a joy to handle that camera.', '2005-07-24 03:06:30.000000', NULL, 0),
