(1631895, 196136, 41098, '<td valign="top">I like the antique look and the "old" feel. Very well captured. I like the webs and busyness of the photo and think you nailed it. Great eye.</td>', 'I like the antique look and the "old" feel. Very well captured. I like the webs and busyness of the photo and think you nailed it. Great eye.', '2005-08-22 15:34:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1677483, 195802, 34659, '<td valign="top">This would have done well in the high contrast challenge as well (I think).  I really like the composition and deep rich tones.  Nice capture.</td>', 'This would have done well in the high contrast challenge as well (I think).  I really like the composition and deep rich tones.  Nice capture.', '2005-09-05 23:32:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1690585, 195005, 36429, '<td valign="top">Only 5.2? Worth much more I think. Looks almost like a face. Good job in getting the shadows lit and the highlights not blown.</td>', 'Only 5.2? Worth much more I think. Looks almost like a face. Good job in getting the shadows lit and the highlights not blown.', '2005-09-09 15:07:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1691302, 195005, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very good shot.  Love again the minimalist feel it has and the composition is great.  The focus is also good, but it''s not quite tack sharp (which I think would help here).  The tones of the image support the obsolete theme and overall I think/thought it was a strong entry.  I scored it a 7.</td>', 'I think this is a very good shot.  Love again the minimalist feel it has and the composition is great.  The focus is also good, but it''s not quite tack sharp (which I think would help here).  The tones of the image support the obsolete theme and overall I think/thought it was a strong entry.  I scored it a 7.', '2005-09-09 20:47:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1692911, 195929, 4285, '<td valign="top">I like the subject matter, the tones and the composition for the most part.  Judging by the edges of the tower against the sky, it looks to be oversharpened.  I think that''s what is causing the noise in the sky too. Depending on what format you shot this with, the original could be sharpened at approx. 125%, 0.5 to 1.0 Radius (0.5 for JPG, 1.0 uncompressed TIF), 0 Threshold as a good starting point.  Then the re-sized version could be re-sharpened using approx. half the Radius.  Hope this is helpful.</td>', 'I like the subject matter, the tones and the composition for the most part.  Judging by the edges of the tower against the sky, it looks to be oversharpened.  I think that''s what is causing the noise in the sky too. Depending on what format you shot this with, the original could be sharpened at approx. 125%, 0.5 to 1.0 Radius (0.5 for JPG, 1.0 uncompressed TIF), 0 Threshold as a good starting point.  Then the re-sized version could be re-sharpened using approx. half the Radius.  Hope this is helpful.', '2005-09-10 13:04:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(1709021, 195276, 16106, '<td valign="top">I agree with most of the comments, though this pretty a shot should never score below a 4 IMHO. The tie in to the challenge has to be so obvious as to risk the cliche, where it will be ripped for being too obvious.</td>', 'I agree with most of the comments, though this pretty a shot should never score below a 4 IMHO. The tie in to the challenge has to be so obvious as to risk the cliche, where it will be ripped for being too obvious.', '2005-09-14 16:02:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1715347, 194334, 14986, '<td valign="top">Great shot for the challenge.  I''m a big fan of contrast, so I probably would have bumped the contrast a bit.  Other than that, I really like the subject, the framing of it with the foreground and the tree, and the overall composition.   Great job!</td>', 'Great shot for the challenge.  I''m a big fan of contrast, so I probably would have bumped the contrast a bit.  Other than that, I really like the subject, the framing of it with the foreground and the tree, and the overall composition.   Great job!', '2005-09-16 22:01:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1716897, 197581, 20018, '<td valign="top">nice balance</td>', 'nice balance', '2005-09-17 22:21:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1725307, 194334, 44551, '<td valign="top">This is nice girlie - I like the framing through the tree :)</td>', 'This is nice girlie - I like the framing through the tree :)', '2005-09-20 21:50:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1757378, 196906, 7570, '<td valign="top">this photo is no longer my personal best :)</td>', 'this photo is no longer my personal best :)', '2005-10-04 02:35:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1758529, 196906, 12253, '<td valign="top">This is a good (and interesting) shot overall.  What might improve it?  It looks as though a bit more contrast would add punch.  Also, the left edge crop is very tight.<br/> <br/>On a reshoot, you might consider the following: the ceiling matches the ladders, and thus, it doesn''t stand apart from its background.  In fact, if you look around the setting, there''s more of that--the reddish wall on the left, the bright background versus the highlights.  Recompose, or even using fill flash to allow the background to be darker in general might make it really stand out.<br/></td>', 'This is a good (and interesting) shot overall.  What might improve it?  It looks as though a bit more contrast would add punch.  Also, the left edge crop is very tight. On a reshoot, you might consider the following: the ceiling matches the ladders, and thus, it doesn''t stand apart from its background.  In fact, if you look around the setting, there''s more of that--the reddish wall on the left, the bright background versus the highlights.  Recompose, or even using fill flash to allow the background to be darker in general might make it really stand out.', '2005-10-04 16:57:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1785338, 196320, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like the compositions, but I also wish the book cover had more impact in the photo.</td>', 'I like the compositions, but I also wish the book cover had more impact in the photo.', '2005-10-15 02:19:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1790171, 197158, 42792, '<td valign="top">Just caught this in your portfolio and saw the related challenge theme.  Can''t believe how tremendously under-rated it was.  I think this shot says so much: the obsolete old building and the values that go with it, to be replaced or overshadowed by a cheap-looking billboard and all the "non-values" that go with that ... Maybe I read too much into an image but I love images that seem to communicate something and if I even succeed just by half to do the same with mine, I''d be happy, which is not the case at the moment :(<br/> <br/></td>', 'Just caught this in your portfolio and saw the related challenge theme.  Can''t believe how tremendously under-rated it was.  I think this shot says so much: the obsolete old building and the values that go with it, to be replaced or overshadowed by a cheap-looking billboard and all the "non-values" that go with that ... Maybe I read too much into an image but I love images that seem to communicate something and if I even succeed just by half to do the same with mine, I''d be happy, which is not the case at the moment :( ', '2005-10-17 14:18:06.000000', NULL, 0),
