(2462043, 197585, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think this has the makings of a really strong shot (I still scored it a 7 during the challenge), but seemed to be "missing" something to push it over the top.  The focus could be a hair sharper, the colors could be pumped up a hair more through curves, maybe some burning/dodging to make it pop a little more...  All the ingredients are there I think.  Still - like I said - I like it and scored it well.  Good job.</td>', 'I think this has the makings of a really strong shot (I still scored it a 7 during the challenge), but seemed to be "missing" something to push it over the top.  The focus could be a hair sharper, the colors could be pumped up a hair more through curves, maybe some burning/dodging to make it pop a little more...  All the ingredients are there I think.  Still - like I said - I like it and scored it well.  Good job.', '2006-05-27 15:19:16.000000', NULL, 0),
